(451, 8, 72, 17, 'GS3100 - GLASS BONG 10 INCH M101001 Mix', 'gs3100-glass-bong-10-inch-m101001-mix', '2552002312422', 0.00, 7.50, 7.50, 0, 'per_quantity', 'GS3100 10\" Heavy Glass Water Pipe\r\nA 10-inch heavy glass water pipe featuring a classic beaker shape, wide stable base and assorted transparent colours. Complete with a removable glass bowl.', '<p data-end=\"304\" data-start=\"248\"><strong data-end=\"304\" data-start=\"248\">GS3100 10&quot; Heavy Glass Water Pipe &ndash; Assorted Colours</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"501\" data-start=\"306\">The GS3100 is a 10-inch water pipe made from thick glass for a sturdy, premium feel. Its classic beaker-shaped body provides a spacious chamber, while the wide flared base offers added stability.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"710\" data-start=\"503\">Supplied in assorted transparent colours including green, black, purple, blue and pink. Each piece features an angled joint with a removable glass bowl, allowing for straightforward cleaning and maintenance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"725\" data-start=\"712\"><strong data-end=\"725\" data-start=\"712\">Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"929\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"726\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"758\" data-section-id=\"3w47ug\" data-start=\"726\">10-inch heavy glass water pipe</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"789\" data-section-id=\"1q0h4yq\" data-start=\"759\">Classic beaker-shaped design</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"828\" data-section-id=\"7btdc0\" data-start=\"790\">Thick and durable glass construction</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"855\" data-section-id=\"1k3dufv\" data-start=\"829\">Wide, stable flared base</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"878\" data-section-id=\"2riu59\" data-start=\"856\">Removable glass bowl</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"909\" data-section-id=\"1c5g9rw\" data-start=\"879\">Assorted transparent colours</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"929\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-section-id=\"v1gdrf\" data-start=\"910\">Model: <strong data-end=\"929\" data-is-last-node=\