(966, 1, 67, 0, 'Satya Dhoop Cones Sandalwood', 'satya-dhoop-cones-sandalwood', '8.90423E+12', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'Satya Dhoop Cones Sandalwood offer a warm, woody and calming fragrance, perfect for creating a peaceful atmosphere during prayer, meditation, relaxation or everyday home use.', '<p>Satya Dhoop Cones Sandalwood are crafted to release a rich, warm and soothing sandalwood aroma that helps create a calm and peaceful environment. Known for its classic woody fragrance, sandalwood is perfect for use during prayer, meditation, yoga, relaxation or simply to freshen up the home.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These dhoop cones burn with a deep, aromatic scent that fills the room beautifully, making them ideal for spiritual use, home fragrance, gifting and everyday ambience. A popular choice from the trusted Satya range, Sandalwood Dhoop Cones are a must-have for incense lovers and wholesale fragrance retailers.<a href=\"https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London\">https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London</a></p>\r\n', 'ky31lq2d5jxsooupcjmuzkhk_large__2_1782901930.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'Discover the wholesale lowest price in the UK, Please registered and get offer price. west London  for wholesale cash and carry.', 'Trusted UK trade-only wholesaler with 10+ years experience supplying smoking accessories, stationery, electronics, cables, lighting .wholesale cash and carry ,etc Register for access wholesale cash and carry', 'all shopkeepers must register for lowest price and offers wholesale cash and carry', 'We promise for lowest price, wholesale cash and carry free delivery traders need register order online  ', 'We provide many items hot deals and offers wholesale cash and carry Through the online our portal:', 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'cheapest for shopkeepers and offlic