(967, 1, 67, 0, 'Satya Dhoop Cones Super Hit', 'satya-dhoop-cones-super-hit', '8.90423E+12', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'Satya Super Hit Dhoop Cones release a rich, sweet and uplifting fragrance that helps create a peaceful, positive and relaxing atmosphere. Satya Super Hit Dhoop Cones are a popular incense choice known for their warm, sweet and slightly exotic aroma.', '<p data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"163\">The fragrance is smooth, calming and uplifting, making it ideal for creating a peaceful environment at home, in prayer rooms, meditation spaces, yoga studios, shops or relaxation areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"830\" data-start=\"485\">The Super Hit scent has a deeper and more luxurious feel compared to simple floral or sweet fragrances. It gives the room a comforting aroma that feels clean, spiritual and welcoming without being too overpowering. Dhoop cones release fragrance in a concentrated way, allowing the scent to spread beautifully through the space as the cone burns.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1179\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"832\">These cones are suitable for prayer, meditation, relaxation, cleansing routines or everyday home fragrance. Place the cone on a heat-resistant incense holder, light the tip, allow it to glow, then gently blow out the flame and let the fragrance slowly fill the room. Always use in a well-ventilated area and never leave burning incense unattended.</p>\r\n', 'ky31lq2d5jxsooupcjmuzkhk_large__1_1782566295.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'Discover the wholesale lowest price in the UK, Please registered and get offer price. west London  for wholesale cash and carry.', 'Trusted UK trade-only wholesaler with 10+ years experience supplying smoking accessories, stationery, electronics, cables, lighting .wholesale cash and carry ,etc Register for access wholesale cash and carry', 'all shopkeepers must register for lowest price and offers wholesale cash and carry', 'We promise for lowest price, wholesale cash and carry free delivery traders need register order online  ', 'We provide many items hot deals and offers wholesale cash and carry Through the online our portal:', 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'cheapest for shopkeepers and offlicense shop,registered online wholesale cash and carry', 'We promise the lowest price in the UK traders wholesale cash and carry in west london', '', '', 'index, follow', '7 days', 'en_gb', 'website', 'https://www.mmswholesale.org  /wholesalecashandcarry', 'Top 10 wholesale traders wholesale cash and carry |mmswholesale.co.uk', 'wholesale cash and carry in west london  | cash and carry', 'https://www.mmswholesale.org/wholesale-cash-and-carry-westlondon', 'online registered and get lowest price free delivery, west London  for wholesale cash and carry.', '', 'mms wholesale', 'https://www.mmswholesale.org/wholesale-cash-and-carry-westlondon', 'online registered and get lowest price free delivery, wholesale cash and carry in west london  | cash and carry   for https://www.mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-westlondon', 'London', '51.46839, -0.36092', '51.46839, -0.36092', 'wholesale supplier cash and carry', 'MMS wholesale cash and carry', 'United Kingdom', 'English', 'London', 'United kingdom', 'Unit D2 ,Tamian Way, Hounslow TW4 6BL Hounslow M:07476043006', 'Public', 'https://www.instagram.com/mmssupplier/', 'https://www.tiktok.com/@mmswholesale/We promise for lowest price, wholesale cash and carry free delivery traders need register order online', 'https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61590860450167', 'https://www.tiktok.com/tiktokstudio', 'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCL_8y6PO6RRRj6gX4GO2ezQ', 0, '2026-05-18 17:19:41', '2026-06-27 18:48:15'),
(968, 1, 67, 0, 'Satya Dhoop Cones Sweet Vanilla', 'satya-dhoop-cones-sweet-vanilla', '8.90423E+12', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'Satya Sweet Vanilla Dhoop Cones create a warm, sweet and comforting vanilla fragrance, perfect for making any room feel calm, cosy and welcoming.', '<p data-end=\"530\" data-start=\"171\">Satya Sweet Vanilla Dhoop Cones are designed to fill your space with a soft, creamy vanilla aroma that feels warm, relaxing and inviting. The sweet vanilla fragrance is gentle but noticeable, making it ideal for everyday use around the home, in a shop, prayer room, meditation space or anywhere you want to create a peaceful atmosphere.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"919\" data-start=\"532\">Unlike stick incense, dhoop cones release fragrance in a more concentrated way, giving a rich burst of aroma as they burn. The scent of sweet vanilla is especially comforting because it has a smooth, dessert-like warmth that helps make the room feel fresh, cosy and pleasant. It is a great choice for people who prefer sweeter fragrances rather than strong floral, woody or spicy scents.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1306\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"921\">These cones are suitable for use during prayer, meditation, yoga, relaxation, cleansing routines or simply to make your room smell beautiful. Place the cone on a heat-resistant incense holder, light the tip, allow it to glow, then blow out the flame and let the fragrance slowly spread through the space. Always use in a well-ventilated area and never leave burning incense unattended.<a href=\"https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London\">https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London</a></p>\r\n', 'OIP___2026_06_27T142350_2251782566660.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'Discover the wholesale lowest price in the UK, Please registered and get offer price. west London  for w