(1036, 1, 0, 0, 'Tridev Agarbatti 6 pack Coconut', 'tridev-agarbatti-6-pack-coconut', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'Tridev Agarbatti 6 Pack Coconut offers a sweet, creamy, and tropical fragrance that helps your space feel fresh, calm, and welcoming. Its smooth coconut-inspired aroma is perfect for prayer, worship, meditation, spiritual moments, room freshening, and everyday use.', '<p><strong>Sweet and creamy</strong>, <strong>Tridev Agarbatti 6 Pack Coconut</strong> releases a soft tropical fragrance inspired by the warm and comforting scent of coconut. The aroma has a smooth, mellow character that feels fresh, pleasant, and slightly sweet, making it a lovely choice for anyone who enjoys gentle and relaxing incense scents.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Coconut</strong> fragrance is ideal for use in prayer rooms, temples, living rooms, bedrooms, shops, studios, or any space where you want a clean and enjoyable scent. Its creamy tropical notes help freshen the surroundings while adding a soft and comforting fragrance that is not too heavy or overpowering.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This <strong>6 pack</strong> is perfect for regular use, giving you more agarbatti sticks to enjoy across the home, workplace, or prayer area. Simply light the tip, allow it to glow, blow out the flame, and place it safely in an incense holder. As it burns, it slowly releases a long-lasting coconut-inspired aroma that helps your space feel peaceful, fresh, and beautifully scented.<a href=\"https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London\">https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London</a></p>\r\n', 'xxg1qqwwbkhempvwrbbq4gih_large1782563118.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'Discover the wholesale lowest price in the UK, Please registered and get offer price. west London  for wholesale cash and carry.', 'Trusted UK trade-only wholesaler with 10+ years experience supplying s