(1052, 1, 65, 0, 'Tridev Incense Stick Balm Mint', 'tridev-incense-stick-balm-mint', '8.90792E+12', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'Tridev Balm Mint Incense Sticks offer a cool, fresh, and minty fragrance that helps create a clean and refreshing atmosphere. Its crisp aroma is perfect for freshening up your space and giving the room a light, uplifting, and calming feel.\r\n', '<section data-testid=\"conversation-turn-46\" data-turn=\"assistant\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:9d714c2a-de20-4d64-aa5d-8a7b4f565846-36\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:9d714c2a-de20-4d64-aa5d-8a7b4f565846-36\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<p data-end=\"518\" data-start=\"267\">Refresh your surroundings with <strong data-end=\"356\" data-start=\"321\">Tridev Balm Mint Incense Sticks</strong>. This fragrance combines a cool minty character with a soothing balm-like freshness, creating a clean and pleasant aroma that feels light, crisp, and comforting.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"808\" data-start=\"520\">The <strong data-end=\"537\" data-start=\"524\">Balm Mint</strong> fragrance is ideal for anyone who enjoys fresh, herbal-style scents. It helps remove unwanted odours while making your space feel bright, calm, and inviting. The cooling mint notes give a refreshing touch, while the balm-inspired aroma adds a smooth and relaxing finish.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1101\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"810\">These incense sticks are perfect for home fragrance, prayer areas, meditation, spiritual moments, shops, studios, or simply freshening up any room. Simply light the tip, let it glow, blow out the flame, and place it safely in an incense holder to enjoy the long-lasting refreshing fragrance.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n', 'feduumfova1bsdipgq1uthgr_large1782560697.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'Discover the wholesale lowest price in the UK, Please registered and get offer price. west London  fo