(1198, 8, 110, 113, 'GS2316 - Ashtray DSI0002 Car Plastic Ashtray MIX COLOUR', 'gs2316-ashtray-dsi0002-car-plastic-ashtray-mix-colour', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'Car Plastic Ashtray Mix Colour is a compact and practical ashtray designed for use in cars and other vehicles. Supplied in assorted colours, it is suitable for car accessory ranges, petrol stations, convenience stores, smoking accessory retailers, and general resale displays.', '<p>The <strong>Car Plastic Ashtray Mix Colour</strong> is a simple and useful smoking accessory designed for customers who need an ashtray while travelling. Made from lightweight plastic, it is easy to carry, easy to place inside a vehicle, and convenient for everyday use in cars, vans, taxis, and other small spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Its compact size makes it suitable for vehicle cup holders, door compartments, dashboards, and storage areas, helping users keep ash and cigarette waste contained while on the move. The plastic construction makes the ashtray easy to empty, wipe, and clean after use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Supplied in a <strong>mixed colour selection</strong>, this product gives retailers a varied and practical option for display. It is ideal for petrol stations, convenience stores, car accessory shops, cash and carry stores, market stalls, and smoking accessory retailers looking to stock a simple everyday item with regular customer demand.<a href=\"https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London\">https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London</a></p>\r\n', 'jfyxptxrmdd0lwpqqvrwbsbr_large1782479980.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'Discover the wholesale lowest price in the UK, Please registered and get offer price. west London  for wholesale cash and carry.', 'Trusted UK trade-only wholesaler with 10+ years experience supplying smoking accessories, stationery, electronics, cables, lighting .w