(1247, 8, 110, 111, 'GS1679 - Ashtray ASH114-DD Smoke Island Rainbow Glass Ashtray Pack Of 6 Skull', 'gs1679-ashtray-ash114-dd-smoke-island-rainbow-glass-ashtray-pack-of-6-skull', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'A bold Smoke Island Rainbow glass ashtray featuring a colourful skull design with a smooth, durable glass finish. Supplied as a pack of 6, this eye-catching smoking accessory is ideal for smoke shops, vape stores, convenience stores and wholesale retail displays.', '<p>Add colour and character to your smoking accessory range with the ASH114-DD Smoke Island Rainbow Glass Ashtray. Designed with a bold skull theme and vibrant rainbow-style artwork, this ashtray offers a standout look that helps attract customer attention on shelves, counters and display areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Made from durable glass, it is practical for regular use while maintaining a clean and stylish appearance. The smooth glass finish makes it easy to wipe clean, while the colourful skull design gives the product a modern, edgy and eye-catching style that appeals to customers looking for something more unique than a plain ashtray.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This ashtray is a strong fit for smoke shops, vape stores, gift shops, convenience stores and wholesale smoking accessory sections. Its bright design makes it especially suitable for display alongside other smoking accessories, novelty items and impulse-buy products.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Supplied as a pack of 6, the ASH114-DD Smoke Island Rainbow Glass Ashtray is a great wholesale option for retailers looking to stock practical, stylish and fast-moving glass ashtrays with strong shelf appeal.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Key Features:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n	<li>Smoke Island Rainbow skull design</li>\r\n	<li>Durable glass construction</li>\r\n	<li>Smooth finish and easy to clean</li>\r\n	<li>Colourful design with strong retail appeal</li>\r\n	<li>Suitable for smoke shops, vape stores, gift shops and convenience stores</li>\r\n	<li>Ideal for