(1281, 8, 110, 111, 'GS1555 - Ashtray ASH114-CT COURNOT Glass Ashtray Pack Of 6 Skull New', 'gs1555-ashtray-ash114-ct-cournot-glass-ashtray-pack-of-6-skull-new', '7494514964027', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'The ASH114-CT Cournot Glass Ashtray Pack of 6 is a bold glass ashtray set featuring a skull-themed Cournot design. It is ideal for retailers looking for a strong novelty smoking accessory that stands out more than a standard plain ashtray. The pack of 6 makes it suitable for resale, counter displays, vape shops, smoking accessory sections, gift shops, market stalls, online stores.', '<section data-testid=\"conversation-turn-54\" data-turn=\"assistant\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:815929dc-45c7-49fa-a682-72bef33bb3d0-94\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:815929dc-45c7-49fa-a682-72bef33bb3d0-94\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<p data-end=\"828\" data-start=\"610\">The <strong data-end=\"649\" data-start=\"614\">Cournot Glass Ashtray Pack of 6</strong> combines everyday practicality with a strong graphic design. Each ashtray is made from glass, giving it a solid feel for regular use while also making it easy to clean after use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1096\" data-start=\"830\">The skull-style Cournot artwork gives the set a darker, more eye-catching look, making it suitable for customers who prefer novelty smoking accessories with character. It works well as part of a wider smoking range and can help add variety to plain ashtray displays.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1322\" data-start=\"1098\">This product is a good choice for convenience stores, cash &amp; carry shops, vape shops, smoking accessory retailers, gift shops, market stalls, online sellers, caf&eacute;s, bars, lounges, garden areas, and designated smoking spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1598\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1324\">Because it comes as a <strong data-end=\"1359\" data-start=\"1346\">pack of 6</strong>, it gives wholesale and retail buyers a practical ready-to-display product with good value and strong shelf appeal. It is also useful for customers who need multiple ashtrays for different rooms, outdoor areas, or social smoking settings.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n', 'g1sr5y1onlyyj401armsm3ux_large1782405453.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'Discover the wholesale lowest price in the UK, Please registered and get offer price. west London  for wholesale cash and carry.', 'Trusted UK trade-only wholesaler with 10+ years experience supplying smoking accessories, stationery, electronics, cables, lighting .wholesale cash and carry ,etc Register for access wholesale cash and carry', 'all shopkeepers must register for lowest price and offers wholesale cash and carry', 'We promise for lowest price, wholesale cash and carry free delivery traders need register order online  ', 'We provide many items hot deals and offers wholesale cash and carry Through the online our portal:', 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'cheapest for shopkeepers and offlicense shop,registered online wholesale cash and carry', 'We promise the lowest price in the UK traders wholesale cash and carry in west london', '', '', 'index, follow', '7 days', 'en_gb', 'website', 'https://www.mmswholesale.org  /wholesalecashandcarry', 'Top 10 wholesale traders wholesale cash and carry |mmswholesale.co.uk', 'wholesale cash and carry in west london  | cash and carry', 'https://www.mmswholesale.org/wholesale-cash-and-carry-westlondon', 'online registered and get lowest price free delivery, west London  for wholesale cash and carry.', '', 'mms wholesale', 'https://www.mmswholesale.org/wholesale-cash-and-carry-westlondon', 'online registered and get lowest price free delivery, wholesale cash and carry in west london  | cash and carry   for https://www.mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-westlondon', 'London', '51.46839, -0.36092', '51.46839, -0.36092'