(1296, 8, 110, 112, 'GS1418 - SET01 HONEYPUFF METAL TRAY WITH MAGNET COVER NEW SMALL 12X7CM', 'gs1418-set01-honeypuff-metal-tray-with-magnet-cover-new-small-12x7cm', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'The SET01 Honeypuff Metal Tray with Magnet Cover is a compact metal rolling tray designed for customers who want a neat, practical, and easy-to-store smoking accessory. Its small 12 x 7cm size makes it ideal for travel, personal use, counter displays, and impulse-buy sections. The magnetic cover helps keep the tray protected when not in use, giving it a cleaner and more convenient finish than a standard open tray.', '<section data-testid=\"conversation-turn-46\" data-turn=\"assistant\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:815929dc-45c7-49fa-a682-72bef33bb3d0-90\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:815929dc-45c7-49fa-a682-72bef33bb3d0-90\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<p data-end=\"783\" data-start=\"555\">The <strong data-end=\"601\" data-start=\"559\">Honeypuff Metal Tray with Magnet Cover</strong> is a useful small-size tray made for everyday convenience. The metal construction gives it a sturdy feel, while the smooth tray surface makes it easy for customers to use and clean.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1045\" data-start=\"785\">The included <strong data-end=\"814\" data-start=\"798\">magnet cover</strong> adds extra practicality, helping to cover the tray between uses and making it easier to store or carry. Its compact size also makes it suitable for customers who prefer a smaller smoking accessory that does not take up much space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1377\" data-start=\"1047\">This product is a good choice for convenience stores, cash &amp; carry shops, vape shops, smoking accessory retailers, gift shops, market stalls, and online sellers. The Honeypuff branding and neat covered design give it strong shelf appeal, especially for customers looking for a compact tray with a more complete, ready-to-use feel.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1545\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-o