(1326, 8, 110, 112, 'GS0733 - 004RA 29x19 Metal Ash Tray WITH COVER LID NEW Bob Marley', 'gs0733-004ra-29x19-metal-ash-tray-with-cover-lid-new-bob-marley', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', '004RA 29x19 Metal Ash Tray with Cover Lid NEW – Bob Marley Design is a large metal ashtray with a practical covered lid to help contain ash and odour. Featuring a bold Bob Marley-style printed design, it is ideal for smoking accessory retailers, gift shops, market traders, convenience stores, and wholesale display.', '<p data-end=\"748\" data-start=\"369\">The <strong data-end=\"442\" data-start=\"373\">004RA 29x19 Metal Ash Tray with Cover Lid NEW &ndash; Bob Marley Design</strong> is a practical and eye-catching ashtray designed for customers who want something larger, more durable, and more decorative than a standard ashtray. With its <strong data-end=\"620\" data-start=\"601\">29 x 19 cm size</strong>, it offers a spacious design suitable for regular use at home, in gardens, smoking areas, lounges, caf&eacute;s, and outdoor settings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1103\" data-start=\"750\">Made from metal, this ashtray is durable, easy to clean, and suitable for everyday use. The added <strong data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"848\">cover lid</strong> helps keep ash contained and gives the product a cleaner, more discreet finish when not in use. The printed Bob Marley-style design adds a recognisable, colourful look that makes it stand out on retail shelves and smoking accessory displays.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1353\" data-start=\"1105\">This item is ideal for wholesalers and retailers supplying smoking accessories, novelty gifts, homeware, and lifestyle products. Its large size, covered lid, and bold design make it a strong choice for customers looking for both function and style.</p>\r\n', 'rd4jcwc4ojeuttgp0a2vqnyh_large1782399962.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'Discover the wholes