(1350, 8, 110, 113, 'GS0057 - Ashtray Ceramic Big gorilla NEW ash320-grs', 'gs0057-ashtray-ceramic-big-gorilla-new-ash320-grs', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'ASH320-GRS Big Gorilla Ceramic Ashtray, a bold novelty ceramic ashtray with a striking gorilla design. Strong, eye-catching, and ideal for smoke shops, gift shops, novelty displays, counters, and home smoking areas.', '<p data-end=\"576\" data-start=\"245\">The <strong data-end=\"314\" data-start=\"272\">ASH320-GRS Big Gorilla Ceramic Ashtray</strong> is a large novelty ashtray designed for customers who want something bold, different, and visually impressive. Featuring a standout <strong data-end=\"469\" data-start=\"447\">big gorilla design</strong>, it adds character to any smoking accessory range and makes a strong display piece for shops and counters.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"854\" data-start=\"578\">Made from ceramic, this ashtray has a solid and premium feel compared to lighter plastic options. Its larger size makes it practical for regular use, while the detailed novelty design gives it strong appeal for customers who like unique, collectible-style smoking accessories.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1097\" data-start=\"856\">This ashtray is suitable for use in homes, lounges, gardens, patios, bars, smoking areas, shop counters, shelves, and novelty displays. The ceramic finish also makes it easy to wipe clean after use, helping keep smoking spaces neat and tidy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1427\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1099\">The <strong data-end=\"1145\" data-start=\"1103\">ASH320-GRS Big Gorilla Ceramic Ashtray</strong> is a great option for <strong data-end=\"1294\" data-start=\"1168\">wholesalers, smoke shops, convenience stores, gift shops, market stalls, novelty stores, pubs, bars, and general retailers</strong>. Practical, durable, and bold in appearance, it is a strong retail product for customers looking for an ashtray with real character.</p>\r\n',