(1365, 8, 110, 112, 'GS0008 - ASH008 Small Spinning Ashtray Small #8 / ASH118', 'gs0008-ash008-small-spinning-ashtray-small-8-ash118', '6907527012087', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'ASH008 / ASH118 Small Spinning Ashtray, also known as Small #8, is a compact spinning ashtray designed to help contain ash and cigarette ends neatly. Ideal for home use, counters, smoking areas, shops, and everyday convenience.', '<section data-testid=\"conversation-turn-12\" data-turn=\"assistant\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:e81ae14b-a86d-4b8e-a7d5-13523b46fd47-38\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:e81ae14b-a86d-4b8e-a7d5-13523b46fd47-38\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<p data-end=\"583\" data-start=\"261\">The <strong data-end=\"339\" data-start=\"288\">ASH008 / ASH118 Small Spinning Ashtray Small #8</strong> is a practical and compact ashtray designed for everyday smoking use. Its spinning push-top design helps move ash and cigarette ends into the base of the ashtray, helping to keep the top area cleaner and reduce loose ash on tables or counters.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"830\" data-start=\"585\">The small size makes it easy to place on desks, coffee tables, shop counters, outdoor smoking areas, patios, gardens, or personal smoking spaces. It is also simple to use, as the spinning lid can be pressed to clear ash into the container below.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1050\" data-start=\"832\">This style of ashtray is popular because it offers a neater alternative to standard open ashtrays. The covered design helps keep cigarette ends more contained, making it useful for both personal use and retail display.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1355\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1052\">The <strong data-end=\"1085\" data-start=\"1056\">Small #8 spinning ashtray</strong> is suitable for <strong data-end=\"1218\" data-start=\"1102\">wholesalers, smoke shops, convenience stores, market stalls, car boot sellers, gift shops, and general retailers</strong>. Compact, practical, and easy to clean, it is a useful smoking accessory for customers looking for a tidy and convenient ashtray option.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n', 'ecwyw0u55jlzqjzo5uom5a5r_large1782392587.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'Discover the wholesale lowest price in the UK, Please registered and get offer price. west London  for wholesale cash and carry.', 'Trusted UK trade-only wholesaler with 10+ years experience supplying smoking accessories, stationery, electronics, cables, lighting .wholesale cash and carry ,etc Register for access wholesale cash and carry', 'all shopkeepers must register for lowest price and offers wholesale cash and carry', 'We promise for lowest price, wholesale cash and carry free delivery traders need register order online  ', 'We provide many items hot deals and offers wholesale cash and carry Through the online our portal:', 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'cheapest for shopkeepers and offlicense shop,registered online wholesale cash and carry', 'We promise the lowest price in the UK traders wholesale cash and carry in west london', '', '', 'index, follow', '7 days', 'en_gb', 'website', 'https://www.mmswholesale.org  /wholesalecashandcarry', 'Top 10 wholesale traders wholesale cash and carry |mmswholesale.co.uk', 'wholesale cash and carry in west london  | cash and carry', 'https://www.mmswholesale.org/wholesale-cash-and-carry-westlondon', 'online registered and get lowest price free delivery, west London  for wholesale cash and carry.', '', 'mms wholesale', 'https://www.mmswholesale.org/wholesale-cash-and-carry-westlondon', 'online registered and get lowest price free delivery, wholesale cash and carry in west london  | cash and carry   for https://www.mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-westlondon', 'London', '51.46839, -0.36092', '51.46839, -0.36092', 'wholesale supplier cash and carry', 'MMS wholesale cash and