(1372, 8, 110, 113, 'Ashtray Car Plastic Ashtray new mix  90177 90161 90162', 'ashtray-car-plastic-ashtray-new-mix-90177-90161-90162', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'Car Plastic Ashtray New Mix including styles 90177, 90161, and 90162. A compact and practical car ashtray designed for convenient use inside vehicles, suitable for cup holders, travel use, and everyday smoking needs.', '<p data-end=\"541\" data-start=\"250\">The <strong data-end=\"308\" data-start=\"277\">Car Plastic Ashtray New Mix</strong> is a practical and convenient ashtray range designed for use inside vehicles. Supplied as a mixed selection of styles including <strong data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"437\">90177, 90161, and 90162</strong>, this product gives customers a variety of car ashtray designs in one range.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"830\" data-start=\"543\">Made from plastic, these ashtrays are lightweight, portable, and easy to place inside most cars, vans, taxis, or travel vehicles. Their compact design makes them ideal for fitting into cup holders, side compartments, or storage areas, helping keep the vehicle cleaner and more organised.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1041\" data-start=\"832\">This car ashtray is useful for safely holding cigarette ash and cigarette ends while driving or travelling. It is also easy to remove, empty, and clean, making it a practical accessory for regular vehicle use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1315\" data-start=\"1043\">The mixed design option makes this product suitable for <strong data-end=\"1208\" data-start=\"1099\">wholesalers, convenience stores, petrol stations, car accessory shops, smoke shops, and general retailers</strong>. Customers can choose from different styles while still getting a simple and useful car smoking accessory.</p>\r\n', 'cfk3tlqh22beudgaagyp22ms_large1782391963.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'Discover the wholesale lowest price in the U