(1373, 8, 110, 111, '5ml WHITE jar SAFETY', '5ml-white-jar-safety', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'A compact 5ml white safety jar designed for secure storage of small quantities of creams, balms, gels, samples, powders, or cosmetic products. Lightweight, practical, and ideal for travel, sampling, and professional packaging.', '<p data-end=\"569\" data-start=\"256\">The <strong data-end=\"307\" data-start=\"283\">5ml white safety jar</strong> is a small, durable, and convenient container made for safely storing and presenting small product quantities. Its clean white colour gives it a neat and professional appearance, making it suitable for cosmetic, beauty, skincare, craft, and general storage use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"901\" data-start=\"571\">With a <strong data-end=\"594\" data-start=\"578\">5ml capacity</strong>, this jar is perfect for products that only need a small portion size, such as <strong data-end=\"805\" data-start=\"674\">cream samples, lip balms, ointments, gels, nail products, loose powders, glitter, beads, pigments, waxes, and travel-size items</strong>. The compact size makes it easy to carry in a handbag, toiletry bag, sample kit, or salon case.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1206\" data-start=\"903\">The safety-style design helps keep the contents contained and protected, reducing the chance of spills or leakage when properly closed. This makes it useful for businesses that need reliable sample packaging, as well as for customers who want a tidy way to store small items at home or while travelling.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1476\" data-start=\"1208\">It is also a good choice for <strong data-end=\"1339\" data-start=\"1237\">beauty salons, skincare brands, pharmacies, craft suppliers, wholesalers, and product sample packs</strong>. The white finish allows labels or branding stickers to stand out clearly, helping create a clean and professional product presentation.<a href=\"https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west Lo