(1497, 3, 57, 94, 'Rizla Polar Blast PK24', 'rizla-polar-blast-pk24', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'Rizla Polar Blast PK24 is a cooling flavour card designed to add an icy, mint-style freshness to rolling tobacco or cigarettes. Customers simply place the card with their tobacco or cigarettes and allow the polar blast flavour to infuse, creating a smoother, fresher smoking experience.', '<p data-end=\"686\" data-start=\"313\">Rizla Polar Blast PK24 is a convenient flavour card made for customers who want to refresh and enhance their smoking experience without changing their usual tobacco or cigarette choice. The card releases a cool, icy polar blast aroma that infuses into rolling tobacco or cigarettes when stored together, giving them a crisp, menthol-style freshness.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1118\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"688\">This product is ideal for customers who miss a cooler menthol taste or prefer a fresher finish when smoking. It is easy to use, compact, and suitable for keeping inside a tobacco pouch, cigarette pack, or storage tin. The PK24 format makes it a strong option for retailers, convenience stores, off-licences, and cash &amp; carry displays, offering customers a simple add-on product with good shelf appeal from the trusted Rizla brand.</p>\r\n', 'OIP___2026_06_19T161707_2481781882309.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 'Best product and best price for trading in ,London wholesale cash and carry', 'Discover the wholesale lowest price in the UK, Please registered and get offer price. west London  for wholesale cash and carry.', 'Trusted UK trade-only wholesaler with 10+ years experience supplying smoking accessories, stationery, electronics, cables, lighting .wholesale cash and carry ,etc Register for access wholesale cash and carry', 'all shopkeepers must register for lowest price and offers wholesale cash and carry', 'We promise for lowest price, wholesale cash and carry free delivery trade