(1509, 3, 57, 93, 'Raw Black 1/4', 'raw-black-14', '716165225829', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'RAW Black 1¼ rolling papers are ultra-thin, unbleached papers designed for a smooth, clean, and slow-burning experience. A premium everyday choice for customers who prefer RAW’s thinnest natural paper in a classic 1¼ size.', '<p data-end=\"523\" data-start=\"273\"><strong data-end=\"289\" data-start=\"273\">RAW Black 1&frac14;</strong> rolling papers are part of RAW&rsquo;s premium Black range, made for customers who want an extra-thin paper with a smooth and natural feel. The 1&frac14; size is a popular everyday format, offering a compact and convenient option for regular use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"797\" data-start=\"525\">Made from natural, unbleached fibres, RAW Black papers are designed to burn slowly and evenly while reducing paper taste. Their ultra-thin design gives a lighter smoking experience, making them a favourite choice among customers looking for a clean, premium rolling paper.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"816\" data-start=\"799\"><strong data-end=\"816\" data-start=\"799\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1071\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"818\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"854\" data-section-id=\"sqpayj\" data-start=\"818\">RAW Black 1&frac14; size rolling papers</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"875\" data-section-id=\"1hiqbli\" data-start=\"855\">Ultra-thin paper</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"906\" data-section-id=\"goof5z\" data-start=\"876\">Natural, unbleached fibres</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"929\" data-section-id=\"1171vkn\" data-start=\"907\">Slow and even burn</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"966\" data-section-id=\"nsd4dj\" data-start=\"930\">Smooth, clean smoking experience</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1000\" data-section-id=\"1ei6gz9\" data-start=\"967\">Classic everyday rolling size</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1028\" data-section-id=\"52a50v\" data-start=\"1001\">Premium RAW Black range</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1071\" data-is-last-node