(1895, 3, 58, 109, 'GS2223 - FILTER TIP BOOKS', 'gs2223-filter-tip-books', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'Filter Tip Books are convenient pre-cut rolling filter tips, designed to make smooth, firm, and easy-to-roll tips every time. Perfect for everyday use, each booklet keeps the tips clean, compact, and ready to use.', '<p data-end=\"588\" data-start=\"278\"><strong data-end=\"298\" data-start=\"278\">Filter Tip Books</strong> are an essential rolling accessory for anyone who prefers a cleaner, smoother, and more comfortable roll. Each booklet contains high-quality pre-cut filter tips that are easy to shape, roll, and use. The compact booklet design makes them simple to carry, store, and access whenever needed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"828\" data-start=\"590\">These filter tips help create a firm mouthpiece, improve airflow, reduce loose material from reaching the mouth, and provide a neater finish to hand-rolled products. Ideal for use with rolling papers, cones, and other smoking accessories.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"847\" data-start=\"830\"><strong data-end=\"847\" data-start=\"830\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1061\" data-start=\"848\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"890\" data-section-id=\"neu3va\" data-start=\"848\">Pre-cut filter tips in a handy booklet</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"917\" data-section-id=\"1v5ceqs\" data-start=\"891\">Easy to roll and shape</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"955\" data-section-id=\"u7bja5\" data-start=\"918\">Helps improve airflow and comfort</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"985\" data-section-id=\"hoei5n\" data-start=\"956\">Keeps rolls neat and firm</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1010\" data-section-id=\"3lovr\" data-start=\"986\">Compact and portable</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1061\" data-section-id=\"437684\" data-start=\"1011\">Suitable for use with rolling papers and cones</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 'seywiy1egl2deyq1qklml5ah_large1781962908.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 16:31:51', '2026-06-20 19:11:48');
