(1935, 4, 50, 0, 'SGK TILL ROLL 5757 Pack Of 20 - GS0468', 'sgk-till-roll-5757-pack-of-20-gs0468', '6959664187121', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 900, 'per_quantity', 'High-quality SGK 57mm x 57mm till rolls, supplied in a convenient pack of 20, ideal for compatible cash registers, receipt printers, POS systems, and payment machines. Suitable for shops, cafés, takeaways, restaurants, offices, salons, and businesses that need smooth, clear, and reliable receipt printing.', '<p data-end=\"700\" data-start=\"376\">The <strong data-end=\"437\" data-start=\"404\">SGK Till Roll 5757 Pack of 20</strong> is a reliable receipt paper option designed for everyday business and retail use. These rolls are suitable for compatible tills, receipt printers, cash registers, card terminals, and POS systems, helping businesses print clear and professional customer receipts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"981\" data-start=\"702\">With a practical <strong data-end=\"739\" data-start=\"719\">57mm x 57mm size</strong>, these till rolls are commonly used in busy retail and hospitality environments where regular receipt printing is needed. The <strong data-end=\"880\" data-start=\"866\">pack of 20</strong> offers great value and ensures businesses have plenty of spare rolls available for daily operations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1128\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"983\">Perfect for convenience stores, supermarkets, takeaways, caf&eacute;s, restaurants, salons, offices, warehouses, market traders, and wholesale counters.</p>\r\n', 'wj0zpjhk215hcrxmxp3thl0w_large1782148929.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-06 15:59:00'),
