(1946, 4, 51, 0, 'Fragile Tape White 100M GS0486', 'fragile-tape-white-100m-gs0486', '506481493154', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 5000, 'per_quantity', 'White Fragile Tape 100m is a strong and highly visible packaging tape designed to clearly mark parcels, boxes, and cartons containing delicate or breakable items. Ideal for warehouses, shops, offices, removals, shipping, and general packaging use.', '<p data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"303\">This <strong data-end=\"359\" data-start=\"332\">White Fragile Tape 100M</strong> is designed to help protect delicate goods during packing, storage, and transport. The clear <strong data-end=\"480\" data-start=\"453\">&ldquo;Fragile&rdquo; warning print</strong> makes it easy for handlers, couriers, warehouse staff, and customers to identify that the parcel contains breakable or sensitive items.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"618\">With a <strong data-end=\"650\" data-start=\"625\">100 metre roll length</strong>, it is suitable for regular packaging use and offers excellent value for businesses that send parcels frequently. It can be used on cardboard boxes, cartons, packages, shipping boxes, storage boxes, and moving boxes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1126\" data-start=\"869\">The white background helps the warning message stand out clearly, giving parcels a professional and noticeable finish. It is ideal for packaging items such as glassware, ceramics, gifts, electronics, homeware, ornaments, bottles, and other fragile products.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1347\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1128\">Easy to apply by hand or with a compatible tape dispenser, this fragile tape is a practical choice for e-commerce sellers, warehouses, wholesalers, retailers, removal companies, offices, and general packing departments.<a href=\"https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London\">https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London</a></p>\r\n', 'bcdct4kyvolbtd2pjfwnioob_large1782233153.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-03 18:21:13'),
(1947, 4, 51, 0, 'Masking Tape White PK6 48X20mm - GS2296', 'masking-tape-white-pk6-48x20mm-gs2296', '6816201948188', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 1900, 'per_quantity', 'Masking Tape White PK6 48mm x 20m is a practical pack of 6 white masking tape rolls, ideal for painting, decorating, labelling, marking, packaging, and general everyday use. The 48mm width provides good surface coverage, while the clean white colour makes it suitable for neat masking lines, temporary fixing, colour coding, and professional trade or DIY jobs. Masking Tape White PK6 48mm x 20m is a practical pack of 6 white masking tape rolls, ideal for painting, decorating, labelling, marking, packaging, and general everyday use.', '<p data-end=\"557\" data-start=\"239\">This <strong data-end=\"294\" data-start=\"268\">White Masking Tape PK6</strong> comes as a handy <strong data-end=\"331\" data-start=\"312\">pack of 6 rolls</strong>, making it a great choice for regular use in homes, offices, warehouses, workshops, schools, and trade environments. Each roll measures <strong data-end=\"482\" data-start=\"468\">48mm x 20m</strong>, giving you a wide tape surface and a good roll length for multiple tasks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"834\" data-start=\"559\">The white masking tape is suitable for <strong data-end=\"625\" data-start=\"598\">painting and decorating</strong>, helping cover edges, borders, trims, and surfaces where protection is needed. It can also be used for <strong data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"729\">labelling, marking, temporary fixing, packaging, craft work, bundling, and colour-coded organisation</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1094\" data-start=\"836\">The <strong data-end=\"854\" data-start=\"840\">48mm width</strong> gives better coverage compared to smaller tapes, making it useful for larger areas and general-purpose jobs. Its clean white finish also makes it suitable for writing on, marking boxes, identifying items, or creating neat temporary labels.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1213\" data-is