(1956, 4, 51, 0, 'SGK Double Sided Tape 24mm GS0487', 'sgk-double-sided-tape-24mm-gs0487', '6920281024059', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 500, 'per_quantity', 'SGK 24mm Double Sided Tape is a strong and easy-to-use adhesive tape with sticky coating on both sides, designed for clean hidden fixing. Ideal for mounting posters, signs, displays, crafts, decorations, packaging, office work, and general DIY use without visible tape, glue, pins, or staples.', '<p data-end=\"544\" data-start=\"202\">The <strong data-end=\"260\" data-start=\"230\">SGK Double Sided Tape 24mm</strong> is a useful everyday adhesive tape designed with sticky adhesive on both sides. This allows two surfaces to be joined together neatly without the tape being visible from the outside. It is a great choice for anyone who needs a clean, simple, and professional-looking fixing solution.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"930\" data-start=\"546\">With its <strong data-end=\"569\" data-start=\"555\">24mm width</strong>, the tape gives a good surface coverage, helping create a stronger bond compared to narrower tapes. It is ideal for sticking posters, signs, labels, decorations, photos, display boards, craft materials, packaging inserts, lightweight trims, and other general items. It can be used in homes, offices, schools, shops, warehouses, workshops, and for DIY projects.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1217\" data-start=\"932\">The double sided design makes it especially useful where a clean finish is needed, as it removes the need for visible tape, pins, nails, glue, or staples. Simply cut the required length, apply it to one surface, remove the backing layer, and press the second surface firmly into place.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1236\" data-start=\"1219\"><strong data-end=\"1236\" data-start=\"1219\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1719\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1238\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1271\" data-section-id=\"k4j8g7\" data-start=\"1238\">SGK branded double sided tape</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1312\" data-section-id=\"sd7nxr\" data-start=\"1272\">24mm wide for better surface contact</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1357\" data-section-id=\"1yphutz\" data-start=\"1313\">Adhesive on both sides for hidden fixing</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1398\" data-section-id=\"1mo1kuk\" data-start=\"1358\">Helps create a neat and clean finish</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1468\" data-section-id=\"1sf8foh\" data-start=\"1399\">Ideal for mounting, sticking, crafting, decorating, and packaging</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1551\" data-section-id=\"d0yr5\" data-start=\"1469\">Useful for posters, signs, labels, displays, photos, and lightweight materials</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1621\" data-section-id=\"6jiyp7\" data-start=\"1552\">Suitable for home, office, school, retail, warehouse, and DIY use</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1653\" data-section-id=\"iv7xb7\" data-start=\"1622\">Easy to cut, apply, and use</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1719\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-section-id=\"x8ppnm\" data-start=\"1654\">A practical alternative to glue, pins, staples, or visible tape.</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1719\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-section-id=\"x8ppnm\" data-start=\"1654\">.<a href=\"https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London\">https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 'uekeryo1wtznksl5gkjonqb3_large1782231999.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-03 18:18:04'),
