(1959, 4, 51, 0, 'Masking Tape YELLOW Single TPMY01 20M Gs2297', 'masking-tape-yellow-single-tpmy01-20m-gs2297', '8394090000875', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 1000, 'per_quantity', 'Yellow masking tape in a single 20m roll, ideal for marking, labelling, colour coding, painting, decorating, and general everyday use.', '<p data-end=\"531\" data-start=\"204\">This <strong data-end=\"263\" data-start=\"233\">Yellow Masking Tape TPMY01</strong> is a practical and easy-to-use tape designed for both professional and everyday tasks. Supplied as a <strong data-end=\"389\" data-start=\"365\">single 20 metre roll</strong>, it is perfect for masking surfaces during painting, temporary fixing, labelling items, craft work, packaging, and colour-coded organisation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"825\" data-start=\"533\">The bright yellow colour makes it highly visible, helping users quickly identify marked areas, sections, or products. It can be applied smoothly to many surfaces and removed easily after use, making it suitable for painters, decorators, warehouses, schools, offices, workshops, and DIY users.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"844\" data-start=\"827\"><strong data-end=\"844\" data-start=\"827\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1128\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"846\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"876\" data-section-id=\"1tukddm\" data-start=\"846\">Bright yellow masking tape</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"892\" data-section-id=\"198orm7\" data-start=\"877\">Single roll</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"912\" data-section-id=\"1t4jyvx\" data-start=\"893\">20 metre length</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"971\" data-section-id=\"4kdeme\" data-start=\"913\">Ideal for painting, decorating, labelling, and marking</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1016\" data-section-id=\"slodjj\" data-start=\"972\">Great for colour coding and organisation</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1072\" data-section-id=\"xutvm2\" data-start=\"1017\">Suitable for home, office, warehouse, and trade use</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1101\" data-section-id=\"nxz7fo\" data-start=\"1073\">Easy to apply and remove.</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1101\" data-section-id=\"nxz7fo\" data-start=\"1073\">.<a href=\"https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London\">https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 'vgqiftofrh4fgiu44bukcpm3_large1782231608.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-03 18:14:57'),
(1960, 4, 51, 0, 'Cello Tape - Foil Tape 50mm BZ6530', 'cello-tape-foil-tape-50mm-bz6530', '9787302048299', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 179, 'per_quantity', 'Cello Tape Foil Tape 50mm is a strong metallic tape, ideal for sealing, joining, patching, insulation work, ducting, pipework, and general repair jobs.', '<section data-testid=\"conversation-turn-56\" data-turn=\"assistant\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:f025c41b-5981-4df2-97ff-83a49b13fdb1-50\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:f025c41b-5981-4df2-97ff-83a49b13fdb1-50\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<p data-end=\"602\" data-start=\"335\">Cello Tape Foil Tape 50mm is a practical foil sealing tape designed for jobs that need a strong, protective, and neat metallic finish. The <strong data-end=\"488\" data-start=\"474\">50mm width</strong> makes it easy to handle while still giving good coverage for sealing gaps, joints, edges, and small repair areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"842\" data-start=\"604\">This tape is commonly used for ducting, ventilation, insulation panels, pipework, heating areas, reflective surfaces, and fixing tasks. It can help seal joins, cover small cracks, patch damaged sections, and provide a clean silver finish.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1110\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"844\">Foil tape is useful for home DIY, workshops, garages, warehouses, building jobs, trade work, and everyday repairs. It is a handy tape for customers who need something stronger and more suitable for sealing and protecting surfaces than standard clear or packing tape.<a href=\"https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London\">https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London</a></p>\r\n</section>\r\n', 'sak3dolod3ybmzw4vwidtlpa_large1782231199.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-03 18:13:12'),
(1961, 4, 51, 0, 'Cello Tape - Foil Tape 75mm', 'cello-tape-foil-tape-75mm', '9780201379624', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 500, 'per_quantity', 'Cello Tape Foil Tape 75mm is a strong metallic sealing tape, ideal for insulation work, ducting, repairs, sealing joints, patching, and general maintenance use.', '<section data-testid=\"conversation-turn-52\" data-turn=\"assistant\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:f025c41b-5981-4df2-97ff-83a49b13fdb1-48\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:f025c41b-5981-4df2-97ff-83a49b13fdb1-48\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<p data-end=\"533\" data-start=\"241\">Cello Tape Foil Tape 75mm is a practical heavy-duty tape designed for jobs that need a strong, heat-reflective and protective finish. The <strong data-end=\"393\" data-start=\"379\">75mm width</strong> gives wider coverage, making it useful for sealing larger gaps, joints, edges, and repair areas more efficiently than standard narrow tape.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"816\" data-start=\"535\">This foil tape is commonly used for ducting, ventilation, insulation panels, pipework, heating areas, reflective surfaces, and general repair work. It can help seal joins, cover cracks, patch small damaged areas, and provide a neat metallic finish where extra protection is needed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1088\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"818\">The tape is suitable for home maintenance, DIY tasks, workshops, garages, warehouses, building work, and trade use. It is a useful product for customers who need a strong tape for sealing, fixing, protecting, and repairing surfaces where normal tape may not be suitable.<a href=\"https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London\">https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-west London</a></p>\r\n</section>\r\n', 'eit5t2lwci0bate2552pqnyw_large1782230964.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''