(1994, 4, 51, 0, 'Duct Tape 24mm X 10m PK2 GREEN GS0542', 'duct-tape-24mm-x-10m-pk2-green-gs0542', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 600, 'per_quantity', 'A strong and reliable green duct tape supplied in a handy pack of 2 rolls. Ideal for sealing, repairing, bundling, labelling, and general everyday use.', '<p data-end=\"569\" data-start=\"214\">This <strong data-end=\"277\" data-start=\"243\">Green Duct Tape 24mm x 10m PK2</strong> is a practical and durable tape solution for both home and trade use. Each pack includes <strong data-end=\"378\" data-start=\"367\">2 rolls</strong>, giving customers extra value and convenience. The 24mm width makes it easy to handle and perfect for smaller repair jobs, craft use, colour coding, packaging, and general maintenance tasks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"881\" data-start=\"571\">Designed with a strong adhesive backing, this duct tape sticks firmly to many surfaces including plastic, cardboard, metal, wood, and fabric. The bright green colour makes it useful for identification, marking, organisation, and decorative purposes, while still offering the strength expected from a duct tape.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"883\">A great wholesale product for hardware shops, discount stores, convenience stores, DIY suppliers, and general retailers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1022\" data-start=\"1005\"><strong data-end=\"1022\" data-start=\"1005\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1271\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1024\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1059\" data-section-id=\"1up9589\" data-start=\"1024\">Pack of 2 green duct tape rolls</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1089\" data-section-id=\"sxg9gf\" data-start=\"1060\">Size: 24mm x 10m per roll</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1114\" data-section-id=\"1q7q5ud\" data-start=\"1090\">Strong adhesive hold</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1141\" data-section-id=\"1tmchfk\" data-start=\"1115\">Easy to tear and apply</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1215\" data-section-id=\"1msc3fr\" d