(1995, 4, 51, 0, 'Duct Tape 24mm X 10m PK2 BLACK GS0520', 'duct-tape-24mm-x-10m-pk2-black-gs0520', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 500, 'per_quantity', 'Black Duct Tape 24mm x 10m PK2, a strong twin pack tape designed for neat repairs, sealing, wrapping, bundling, packaging, and general maintenance use.', '<p data-end=\"476\" data-start=\"182\">The <strong data-end=\"244\" data-start=\"210\">Black Duct Tape 24mm x 10m PK2</strong> is a practical two-roll pack suitable for everyday fixing and repair jobs. With its slimmer <strong data-end=\"351\" data-start=\"337\">24mm width</strong>,<a href=\"https://www.mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-westlondon\">https://www.mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-westlondon</a> this tape is ideal for smaller areas where standard duct tape may be too wide, giving a cleaner and more controlled finish.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"687\" data-start=\"478\">Each roll provides strong adhesive hold for sealing, patching, securing, joining, and wrapping materials. It can be used around the home, garage, warehouse, office, workshop, retail stockroom, or packing area.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"966\" data-start=\"689\">The black colour gives the tape a neat and professional look, making it useful for discreet repairs, cable tidying, colour-coding, product marking, and general organisation. The twin pack offers better value and is convenient for customers who need spare rolls for regular use.<a href=\"https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-westlondon\">https://mmswholesale.co.uk/wholesale-cash-and-carry-westlondon</a></p>\r\n', '3zgd1oowkgjimwzy4cxq2ced_large1782219914.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-03 04:49:44'),
(1996, 4, 51, 0, 'Duct Tape 24mm X 10m PK2 SILVER GS0519', 'duct-tape-24mm-x-10m-pk2-silver-gs0519', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 500, 'per_quantity', 'Silver Duct Tape 24mm x 10m PK2, a strong and practical twin pack tape for repairs, sealing, wrapping, patching, and everyday maintenance use.', '<p data-end=\"472\" data-start=\"173\">The <strong data-end=\"236\" data-start=\"201\">Silver Duct Tape 24mm x 10m PK2</strong> is a useful multi-purpose tape set designed for trade, retail, warehouse, garage, office, and household use. Each pack includes <strong data-end=\"376\" data-start=\"365\">2 rolls</strong>, giving customers extra value and making it ideal for regular fixing, sealing, and repair jobs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"735\" data-start=\"474\">The narrower <strong data-end=\"501\" data-start=\"487\">24mm width</strong> is especially handy for smaller tasks where a full-width duct tape may be too wide. It can be used for neat repairs, light patching, securing small items, wrapping edges, sealing gaps, bundling products, and general maintenance work.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"988\" data-start=\"737\">Its silver finish gives it a classic duct tape look, making it suitable for a wide range of surfaces and everyday applications. The tape is easy to handle, simple to apply, and can be torn by hand for quick use during busy trade, packing, or DIY jobs.</p>\r\n', 'chsz50kpocm05srnspyktgzi_large1782219025.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-03 04:28:07'),
(1997, 4, 51, 0, 'Duct Tape 48mm X 10m RED GS0518', 'duct-tape-48mm-x-10m-red-gs0518', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 400, 'per_quantity', 'Red Duct Tape 48mm x 10m with a strong adhesive hold, suitable for repair work, packaging, marking, sealing, and colour-coded use.', '<p data-end=\"446\" data-start=\"161\">The <strong data-end=\"217\" data-start=\"189\">Red Duct Tape 48mm x 10m</strong> is a practical all-purpose tape made for both trade and everyday use. It is a useful item for wholesalers, hardware retailers, warehouses, garages, offices, workshops, and home users who need a strong tape for quick fixing jobs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"691\" data-start=\"448\">Its adhesive backing helps the tape hold firmly when used for sealing, securing, joining, covering, or reinforcing materials. It can be used on cartons, packaging, loose items, temporary repairs, surface patches, and general maintenance tasks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"945\" data-start=\"693\">The red colour gives this tape an added advantage where visibility is important. It can be used to highlight items, mark important areas, organise stock, separate product categories, label temporary sections, or support workplace colour-coding systems.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1210\" data-start=\"947\">With a <strong data-end=\"968\" data-start=\"954\">48mm width</strong>, the tape provides good coverage for everyday jobs, while the <strong data-end=\"1050\" data-start=\"1031\">10m roll length</strong> makes it easy to store, carry, and use when needed. It is also easy to apply and can be torn by hand, making it convenient for fast-paced working environments.</p>\r\n', 'r5mrc2tmcnsdszq2wlpk5cca_large1782218868.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-03 04:26:26'),
(1998, 4, 51, 0, 'Duct Tape 48mm X 10m YELLOW GS0517', 'duct-tape-48mm-x-10m-yellow-gs0517', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 400, 'per_quantity', 'Durable Yellow Duct Tape 48mm x 10m, suitable for repairs, sealing, packaging, securing items, marking areas, and colour-coded organisation.', '<p data-end=\"496\" data-start=\"171\">This <strong data-end=\"231\" data-start=\"200\">Yellow Duct Tape 48mm x 10m</strong> is a strong and practical tape designed for everyday use in shops, warehouses, garages, offices, workshops, and general household environments. It is a useful product for customers who need a reliable tape for fixing, holding, covering, and temporary repair tasks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"772\" data-start=\"498\">The tape can be used to seal cartons, reinforce packaging, patch small damaged areas, bundle products together, secure loose materials, or cover gaps and joins. Its 48mm width provides good coverage, while the 10m roll size makes it easy to store, handle, and use regularly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1073\" data-start=\"774\">The bright yellow colour makes this tape especially useful for visibility, warning marks, colour-coding, stock separation, temporary labelling, and marking specific areas or items. It is ideal for workplaces that need clear identification, organised storage, or easy-to-spot tape for practical jobs.</p>\r\n', 'rhlg3p3gccx5eayyneculofm_large1782218658.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-02 22:14:44'),
(1999, 4, 51, 0, 'Duct Tape 48mm X 10m BLUE GS0516', 'duct-tape-48mm-x-10m-blue-gs0516', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 600, 'per_quantity', 'Strong Blue Duct Tape 48mm x 10m, perfect for repairs, securing items, sealing, packaging, colour marking, and everyday trade or household use.', '<p data-end=\"423\" data-start=\"174\">This <strong data-end=\"232\" data-start=\"203\">Blue Duct Tape 48mm x 10m</strong> is a tough and dependable tape made for a wide range of general-purpose jobs. It is ideal for use in warehouses, hardware shops, garages, offices, workshops, stockrooms, and around the home.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"685\" data-start=\"425\">The tape is designed to give a secure hold when fixing, joining, covering, or reinforcing items. It can be used for taping cartons, holding materials in place, covering small splits or damaged areas, tying products together, and carrying out temporary repairs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"687\">Its bright blue colour makes it a useful choice for identifying stock, separating product groups, marking areas, labelling items, or using as part of a colour-coded system. This makes it especially practical for organised workplaces, storage areas, and trade environments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1202\" data-start=\"961\">With a practical 48mm width and 10m roll length, it offers good coverage while remaining easy to handle. The tape can be applied quickly and torn by hand, making it convenient for fast jobs where scissors or cutters are not always available.</p>\r\n', 'jrtvizkcgqv40ug0xu02yg1j_large1782218488.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-02 22:07:19'),
(2000, 4, 51, 0, 'Duct Tape 48mm X 10m GREEN GS0514', 'duct-tape-48mm-x-10m-green-gs0514', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 300, 'per_quantity', 'Heavy-duty green duct tape with strong adhesive grip, ideal for repairs, sealing, bundling, packaging, marking, and general maintenance use.', '<p data-end=\"546\" data-start=\"192\">The <strong data-end=\"250\" data-start=\"220\">Green Duct Tape 48mm x 10m</strong> is a strong and reliable multi-purpose tape designed for everyday use in trade, wholesale, retail, warehouse, garage, office, and household environments. Made for practical fixing and maintenance jobs, this tape provides a firm adhesive hold and is suitable for a wide range of general surfaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"849\" data-start=\"548\">It can be used for quick repairs, sealing boxes or gaps, patching damaged areas, securing loose items, bundling products together, wrapping materials, and temporary fixing tasks. The 48mm width gives good coverage, while the 10m roll length makes it convenient for regular use without being too bulky.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1116\" data-start=\"851\">The green colour is especially useful for <strong data-end=\"1014\" data-start=\"893\">colour-coding, marking, identifying areas, temporary labelling, garden use, stock organisation, and warehouse sorting</strong>. It is also a good option where a coloured tape is preferred over standard silver or black duct tape.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1118\">Easy to apply and tear by hand, this duct tape is a practical everyday item for customers who need a strong tape for repairs, packaging, DIY jobs, maintenance work, and general fixing tasks.</p>\r\n', 'nlhp0cwphes4zkyzlieywdnk_large1782218242.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-02 21:59:02'),
(2001, 4, 51, 0, 'Duct Tape 48mm X 10m SILVER GS0513', 'duct-tape-48mm-x-10m-silver-gs0513', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 700, 'per_quantity', 'A strong, multi-purpose silver duct tape designed for everyday repairs, sealing, patching, and fixing. It sticks securely to many surfaces and is useful for home, office, warehouse, garage, and DIY jobs. The tape can be torn by hand, making it quick and easy to use without scissors.', '<p data-end=\"513\" data-start=\"169\">This <strong data-end=\"229\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"198\">Silver Duct Tape 48mm x 10m</strong> is a heavy-duty, multi-purpose tape designed for strong adhesion and reliable performance. Its durable silver finish makes it suitable for repairs, sealing gaps, holding materials together, covering joints, and temporary fixes around the home, warehouse, office, garage, or worksite.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"792\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"515\">The tape is easy to apply, tears by hand, and sticks well to many surfaces, making it a practical everyday essential for DIY, packaging, maintenance, and general repair tasks. Its 48mm width provides good coverage, while the 10m roll length makes it convenient for regular use. Strong and reliable <strong data-end=\"76\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"45\">Silver Duct Tape 48mm x 10m</strong>, ideal for quick repairs, sealing, bundling, patching, and general household or trade use.</p>\r\n', 'urtrkxjvmg0wl03yfi54qnln_large1782217842.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-02 21:50:51'),
(2002, 4, 51, 0, 'Duct Tape 48mm X 10m BLACK GS0512', 'duct-tape-48mm-x-10m-black-gs0512', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 600, 'per_quantity', 'Black duct tape, 48mm x 10m, designed for strong repairs, sealing, bundling, and general fixing jobs. Ideal for home, warehouse, workshop, and everyday use.', '<p data-end=\"580\" data-start=\"187\"><strong data-end=\"241\" data-start=\"211\">Duct Tape 48mm x 10m Black</strong> is a strong and practical multi-purpose tape suitable for a wide range of repair, sealing, and fixing tasks. With its <strong data-end=\"374\" data-start=\"360\">48mm width</strong>, it gives good coverage for patching, joining, wrapping, and securing different surfaces, while the <strong data-end=\"494\" data-start=\"475\">10m roll length</strong> makes it useful for everyday jobs around the home, workplace, warehouse, or workshop.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"831\" data-start=\"582\">The black finish gives a neat and clean look, especially when used on dark surfaces, cables, equipment, packaging, or temporary repairs. It is ideal for bundling items together, sealing gaps, holding materials in place, and general maintenance work.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"983\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"833\">Perfect for DIY use, repairs, packing, warehouse tasks, cable management, temporary fixes, and general-purpose sticking where a strong tape is needed.</p>\r\n', 'n2gb51dokf0pxpn4dly313i5_large1782214237.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-02 21:46:17'),
(2003, 4, 51, 0, 'Jumbo Tape 200m TPB01 Brown 50x200 GS2540', 'jumbo-tape-200m-tpb01-brown-50x200-gs2540', '', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'ART NO. GS2540\r\nCTN/QTY - 36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-06-20 22:20:25'),
(2004, 4, 51, 0, 'Jumbo Tape 200m TPC01 Clear 50x200 - GS2539', 'jumbo-tape-200m-tpc01-clear-50x200-gs2539', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 600, 'per_quantity', 'Clear jumbo packing tape, 50mm x 200m, made for strong carton sealing, parcel packing, warehouse use, and everyday packaging. The long 200m roll lasts longer than standard tape, making it ideal for regular business use.', '<p data-end=\"622\" data-start=\"250\"><strong data-end=\"312\" data-start=\"274\">Jumbo Tape 200m TPC01 Clear 50x200</strong> is a reliable clear packaging tape designed for sealing boxes, cartons, parcels, and shipping packages securely. With a wide <strong data-end=\"446\" data-start=\"438\">50mm</strong> tape width and a long <strong data-end=\"477\" data-start=\"469\">200m</strong> roll length, it is ideal for busy warehouses, retail shops, offices, stockrooms, wholesalers, and packing stations where tape is used regularly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"996\" data-start=\"624\">The clear finish helps keep packaging looking neat and professional, especially when used on plain or printed boxes. Its strong adhesive provides a firm hold, helping cartons stay closed during storage, handling, and delivery. The jumbo roll size gives better value and reduces the need to replace rolls as often, making it a practical choice for high-volume packing work.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1118\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"998\">Perfect for parcel dispatch, moving boxes, e-commerce orders, wholesale packaging, and general day-to-day sealing tasks.</p>\r\n', 'a1s5uglkhopdshgg0p0q54yu_large1782214066.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-02 21:16:37'),
(2005, 4, 51, 0, 'CLEAR TAPE NEW 1830 30M PK8 TPC08 - GS2083', 'clear-tape-new-1830-30m-pk8-tpc08-gs2083', '50604612667104', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 300, 'per_quantity', 'The Clear Tape New 1830 TPC08 is a transparent general-purpose adhesive tape supplied in a pack of 8 rolls, with each roll measuring 30 metres. Suitable for sealing parcels, packaging goods, wrapping products, attaching labels, light repairs, and everyday stationery or trade use.', '<p data-end=\"708\" data-start=\"358\">The <strong data-end=\"423\" data-start=\"386\">Clear Tape New 1830 30m PK8 TPC08</strong> is a practical clear adhesive tape designed for regular packaging, sealing, and general-purpose use. Its transparent finish gives a clean and tidy look, making it suitable for sealing boxes, wrapping items, securing labels, repairing paper, and holding lightweight materials in place.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1060\" data-start=\"710\">Each roll measures <strong data-end=\"742\" data-start=\"729\">30 metres</strong>, and the pack includes <strong data-end=\"777\" data-start=\"766\">8 rolls</strong>, giving a useful quantity for packing stations, retail counters, stock rooms, offices, stationery suppliers, and general trade environments. The clear design allows labels, writing, and packaging details to remain visible underneath, helping maintain a neat and professional finish.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1079\" data-start=\"1062\"><strong data-end=\"1079\" data-start=\"1062\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1384\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1080\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1105\" data-section-id=\"1vwe3jv\" data-start=\"1080\">Product code: <strong data-end=\"1105\" data-start=\"1096\">TPC08</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1123\" data-section-id=\"1ke4gxj\" data-start=\"1106\">Model: <strong data-end=\"1123\" data-start=\"1115\">1830</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1157\" data-section-id=\"vu093e\" data-start=\"1124\">Colour: <strong data-end=\"1157\" data-start=\"1134\">Clear / Transparent</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1184\" data-section-id=\"1emehay\" data-start=\"1158\">Length per roll: <strong data-end=\"1184\" data-start=\"1177\">30m</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1213\" data-section-id=\"e8mt7q\" data-start=\"1185\">Pack quantity: <strong data-end=\"1213\" data-start=\"1202\">8 rolls</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1272\" data-section-id=\"m85h0v\" data-start=\"1214\">Suitable for sealing, packaging, wrapping, and labelling</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1316\" data-section-id=\"do6f4s\" data-start=\"1273\">Transparent finish for a clean appearance</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1384\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-section-id=\"y1d294\" data-start=\"1317\">Useful for retail, office, warehouse, packing, and stationery use.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '5t5tbkkjb4h1dqk0tj0sj3tc_large1782213829.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-02 18:16:57'),
(2006, 4, 51, 0, 'MIX TAPE NEW 1830 30M PK8 TPMX08 - GS2082', 'mix-tape-new-1830-30m-pk8-tpmx08-gs2082', '50604612667103', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 500, 'per_quantity', 'The Mix Tape New 1830 TPMX08 is a mixed-colour general-purpose adhesive tape supplied in a pack of 8 rolls, with each roll measuring 30 metres. Suitable for packaging, sealing, wrapping, colour coding, labelling, organising stock, and everyday trade or stationery use.', '<p data-end=\"691\" data-start=\"345\">The <strong data-end=\"409\" data-start=\"373\">Mix Tape New 1830 30m PK8 TPMX08</strong> is a practical multi-purpose tape set designed for regular packaging and general use. The mixed colours make it useful not only for sealing and securing items, but also for <strong data-end=\"690\" data-start=\"583\">colour coding, product identification, stock organisation, and marking different sections or categories</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1072\" data-start=\"693\">Each roll measures <strong data-end=\"725\" data-start=\"712\">30 metres</strong>, giving a good length for repeated use, while the <strong data-end=\"795\" data-start=\"776\">pack of 8 rolls</strong> makes it a convenient choice for retail counters, packing stations, offices, stock rooms, stationery suppliers, and general trade environments. It can be used for sealing parcels, wrapping products, grouping items together, attaching labels, and organising goods more clearly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"1074\"><strong data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"1074\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1394\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1092\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1118\" data-section-id=\"174f5fx\" data-start=\"1092\">Product code: <strong data-end=\"1118\" data-start=\"1108\">TPMX08</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1136\" data-section-id=\"1ke4gxj\" data-start=\"1119\">Model: <strong data-end=\"1136\" data-start=\"1128\">1830</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1163\" data-section-id=\"1emehay\" data-start=\"1137\">Length per roll: <strong data-end=\"1163\" data-start=\"1156\">30m</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1192\" data-section-id=\"e8mt7q\" data-start=\"1164\">Pack quantity: <strong data-end=\"1192\" data-start=\"1181\">8 rolls</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1216\" data-section-id=\"1r2zjxu\" data-start=\"1193\">Mixed-colour tape set</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1275\" data-section-id=\"gzj567\" data-start=\"1217\">Suitable for packaging, sealing, wrapping, and labelling</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1327\" data-section-id=\"199wh9q\" data-start=\"1276\">Useful for colour coding and stock identification.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 'pxcyyzazquwh4mxvqe3ebimy_large1782213640.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-02 18:11:25'),
(2007, 4, 51, 0, 'Reflective Tape 50mm X 5M Arrow Z85005A GS0483', 'reflective-tape-50mm-x-5m-arrow-z85005a-gs0483', '6920289750059', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 1200, 'per_quantity', 'The Reflective Tape Arrow Z85005A is a high-visibility safety tape measuring 50mm x 5m, designed with an arrow pattern to help highlight direction, hazards, edges, vehicles, equipment, and restricted areas. Ideal for safety marking, warehouse use, parking areas, loading bays, trailers, gates, posts, and general visibility applications.', '<p data-end=\"707\" data-start=\"417\">The <strong data-end=\"488\" data-start=\"445\">Reflective Tape 50mm x 5m Arrow Z85005A</strong> is a practical safety marking tape designed to improve visibility in low-light conditions. The reflective surface helps catch light from vehicles, torches, and other light sources, making marked areas easier to notice.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"991\" data-start=\"709\">Its arrow design makes it especially useful for showing direction, guiding movement, marking routes, or drawing attention to specific areas. It can be applied to smooth, clean surfaces such as metal, plastic, glass, painted surfaces, posts, barriers, trailers, doors, and equipment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1214\" data-start=\"993\">This tape is suitable for use in warehouses, stock rooms, loading areas, car parks, workshops, delivery vehicles, construction areas, and general trade environments where clear visibility and safety marking are important.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1233\" data-start=\"1216\"><strong data-end=\"1233\" data-start=\"1216\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1545\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1234\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1261\" data-section-id=\"1t88z5j\" data-start=\"1234\">Product code: <strong data-end=\"1261\" data-start=\"1250\">Z85005A</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1283\" data-section-id=\"m94kvm\" data-start=\"1262\">Size: <strong data-end=\"1283\" data-start=\"1270\">50mm x 5m</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1308\" data-section-id=\"4s1bgh\" data-start=\"1284\">Reflective safety tape</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1354\" data-section-id=\"1rlhdb9\" data-start=\"1309\">Arrow pattern for direction and warning use</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1400\" data-section-id=\"d7zjqq\" data-start=\"1355\">Helps improve visibility in low-light areas</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1470\" data-section-id=\"azvt3l\" data-start=\"1401\">Suitable for marking hazards, edges, posts, vehicles, and equipment</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1545\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-section-id=\"yqo739\" data-start=\"1471\">Useful for warehouses, car parks, loading bays, workshops, and trade use.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '0elkz5fvhzbx3ltpnf4wcdes_large1782213396.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-01 21:42:17'),
(2008, 4, 51, 0, 'CLEAR TAPE NEW 1220 20M PK12 TPC012 - GS1837', 'clear-tape-new-1220-20m-pk12-tpc012-gs1837', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 500, 'per_quantity', 'The Clear Tape New 1220 TPC012 is a transparent general-purpose adhesive tape supplied in a pack of 12 rolls, with each roll measuring 20 metres. Ideal for sealing parcels, packaging goods, wrapping items, attaching labels, light repairs, and everyday stationery use.', '<p data-end=\"828\" data-start=\"498\">The <strong data-end=\"565\" data-start=\"526\">Clear Tape New 1220 20m PK12 TPC012</strong> is a practical everyday tape designed for packaging, sealing, and general use. Its clear finish gives a neat and discreet look, making it suitable for sealing boxes, wrapping products, repairing paper, securing labels, and holding lightweight materials in place.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1190\" data-start=\"830\">Each roll provides <strong data-end=\"862\" data-start=\"849\">20 metres</strong> of tape, and the pack includes <strong data-end=\"906\" data-start=\"894\">12 rolls</strong>, making it a convenient choice for retail counters, offices, stock rooms, packing stations, stationery suppliers, and general trade use. The transparent design allows labels, writing, and packaging details to remain visible underneath, helping create a clean and professional finish.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1209\" data-start=\"1192\"><strong data-end=\"1209\" data-start=\"1192\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1519\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1210\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1236\" data-section-id=\"12q6xvk\" data-start=\"1210\">Product code: <strong data-end=\"1236\" data-start=\"1226\">TPC012</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1254\" data-section-id=\"1kl1asc\" data-start=\"1237\">Model: <strong data-end=\"1254\" data-start=\"1246\">1220</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1288\" data-section-id=\"vu093e\" data-start=\"1255\">Colour: <strong data-end=\"1288\" data-start=\"1265\">Clear / Trans