8mm x 50m</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1165\" data-section-id=\"r2fo72\" data-start=\"1145\">Colour: <strong data-end=\"1165\" data-start=\"1155\">Yellow</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1194\" data-section-id=\"pqb8fc\" data-start=\"1166\">Pack quantity: <strong data-end=\"1194\" data-start=\"1183\">6 rolls</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1251\" data-section-id=\"72j6th\" data-start=\"1195\">Suitable for packaging, sealing, marking, and bundling</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1301\" data-section-id=\"1sct2pi\" data-start=\"1252\">Useful for colour coding and stock organisation</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1337\" data-section-id=\"oocjwx\" data-start=\"1302\">Bright colour for easy visibility.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '522lmkvvlcharwdnan2apzen_large1782213066.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-06-23 16:41:06'),
(2010, 4, 51, 0, 'Duct Tape 48mm X 10 TPD01 mix colour  - GS1834', 'duct-tape-48mm-x-10-tpd01-mix-colour-gs1834', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 2000, 'per_quantity', 'The Duct Tape TPD01 is a strong mixed-colour duct tape measuring 48mm x 10m, ideal for sealing, repairing, bundling, patching, colour coding, and general everyday use at home, in shops, warehouses, garages, offices, and workshops.', '<p data-end=\"650\" data-start=\"308\">The <strong data-end=\"377\" data-start=\"336\">Duct Tape 48mm x 10m TPD01 Mix Colour</strong> is a durable and versatile adhesive tape designed for a wide range of practical uses. With its strong adhesive backing and flexible material, it is suitable for quick repairs, securing items, sealing boxes, patching surfaces, bundling cables, and general maintenance work.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"652\">The mixed-colour option makes it useful not only for repairs and sealing, but also for <strong data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"739\">colour coding, marking, organising stock, identifying items, and labelling different areas</strong>. It can be used in retail shops, warehouses, offices, schools, garages, workshops, and around the home.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1059\" data-start=\"939\">Easy to apply and convenient for everyday use, this duct tape is a handy item for both professional and household tasks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"1061\"><strong data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"1061\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1350\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1079\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1104\" data-section-id=\"1vvq2k5\" data-start=\"1079\">Product code: <strong data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1095\">TPD01</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1127\" data-section-id=\"1yjfff3\" data-start=\"1105\">Size: <strong data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1113\">48mm x 10m</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1152\" data-section-id=\"qcqufv\" data-start=\"1128\">Mixed colour duct tape</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1175\" data-section-id=\"1le28lx\" data-start=\"1153\">Strong adhesive hold</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1233\" data-section-id=\"1cz7h5o\" data-start=\"1176\">Suitable for sealing, repairing, patching, and bundling</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1287\" data-section-id=\"tykmar\" data-start=\"1234\">Useful for marking, colour coding, and organisation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 'b3ed0bdgszggkflmmyvxu0wt_large1782212925.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-01 21:13:55'),
