(2021, 4, 51, 0, 'Duct tape 48MM x 20M RED GS2589', 'duct-tape-48mm-x-20m-red-gs2589', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 400, 'per_quantity', 'Duct Tape 48mm x 20m Red is a versatile, heavy-duty tape designed for everyday fixing, sealing, binding, and colour marking. Its bold red colour makes it ideal for easy identification in homes, shops, warehouses, and workspaces.', '<p data-end=\"528\" data-start=\"281\"><strong data-end=\"309\" data-start=\"281\">Duct Tape 48mm x 20m Red</strong> is a practical adhesive tape made for a wide range of general-purpose jobs. It can be used for sealing packages, holding items together, covering small repairs, organising stock, and marking specific areas or products.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"530\">With a <strong data-end=\"551\" data-start=\"537\">48mm width</strong> and <strong data-end=\"575\" data-start=\"556\">20 metre length</strong>, this roll offers a useful size for regular use in retail, trade, warehouse, office, school, and household settings. The red colour stands out clearly, making it suitable for colour coding, warning labels, temporary marking, and quick visual identification.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"966\" data-start=\"835\">This product is a strong choice for wholesalers, hardware stores, convenience shops, pound lines, market traders, and DIY sections.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"985\" data-start=\"968\"><strong data-end=\"985\" data-start=\"968\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1279\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"986\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1017\" data-section-id=\"1moje07\" data-start=\"986\">Red multi-purpose duct tape</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1043\" data-section-id=\"dbnpch\" data-start=\"1018\">Roll size: 48mm x 20m</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1098\" data-section-id=\"1di0zst\" data-start=\"1044\">Suitable for sealing, fixing, binding, and marking</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1134\" data-section-id=\"xszkgm\" data-start=\"1099\">Bold colour for easy visibility</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1192\" data-section-id=\"mv3eq6\" data-start=\"1135\">Useful for stock control, packaging, and organisation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '3sqkpkg0uc3het04tyowa5zx_large1782211441.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-01 19:27:12'),
(2022, 4, 51, 0, 'Duct tape 48MM x 20M YELLOW GS2588', 'duct-tape-48mm-x-20m-yellow-gs2588', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 400, 'per_quantity', 'Duct Tape 48mm x 20m Yellow is a strong, durable multi-purpose tape suitable for sealing, bundling, repairs, marking, colour coding, and general heavy-duty use.', '<p data-end=\"528\" data-start=\"268\"><strong data-end=\"299\" data-start=\"268\">Duct Tape 48mm x 20m Yellow</strong> is a reliable adhesive tape designed for practical everyday tasks. With a <strong data-end=\"388\" data-start=\"374\">48mm width</strong> and <strong data-end=\"417\" data-start=\"393\">20 metre roll length</strong>, it is ideal for securing parcels, bundling items, temporary repairs, packaging, and general maintenance jobs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"775\" data-start=\"530\">The bright yellow colour makes it useful for marking, colour coding, organising, safety identification, and areas where high visibility is needed. Suitable for use in warehouses, shops, offices, homes, schools, workshops, and trade environments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"917\" data-start=\"777\">A great product for wholesalers, hardware shops, pound stores, convenience stores, market traders, DIY sections, and general retail display.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"936\" data-start=\"919\"><strong data-end=\"936\" data-start=\"919\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1204\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"937\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"957\" data-section-id=\"5rwdii\" data-start=\"937\">Yellow duct tape</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"978\" data-section-id=\"9jtc24\" data-start=\"958\">Size: 48mm x 20m</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1003\" data-section-id=\"1q7q5ud\" data-start=\"979\">Strong adhesive hold</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1060\" data-section-id=\"17um14k\" data-start=\"1004\">Suitable for sealing, bundling, repairs, and marking</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1109\" data-section-id=\"1ug2d0s\" data-start=\"1061\">Useful for colour coding and high visibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 'iztftzqaeknertrrof00kjgi_large1782211268.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-07-01 19:12:20'),
(2023, 4, 51, 0, 'Duct tape 48MM x 20M BLUE GS2587', 'duct-tape-48mm-x-20m-blue-gs2587', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 800, 'per_quantity', 'Duct Tape 48mm x 20m Blue is a strong, durable multi-purpose tape suitable for sealing, bundling, repairs, marking, colour coding, and general heavy-duty use. Ideal for home, office, warehouse, trade, and DIY environments.', '<p data-end=\"532\" data-start=\"275\"><strong data-end=\"304\" data-start=\"275\">Duct Tape 48mm x 20m Blue</strong> is a reliable adhesive tape designed for practical everyday use. With a <strong data-end=\"391\" data-start=\"377\">48mm width</strong> and <strong data-end=\"420\" data-start=\"396\">20 metre roll length</strong>, it is ideal for securing parcels, bundling items, temporary repairs, packaging, and general maintenance tasks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"776\" data-start=\"534\">The blue colour makes it useful for colour coding, marking, organising, stock identification, and areas where clear visibility is needed. It is suitable for use in warehouses, shops, offices, homes, schools, workshops, and trade environments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"918\" data-start=\"778\">A great product for wholesalers, hardware shops, pound stores, convenience stores, market traders, DIY sections, and general retail display.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"920\"><strong data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"920\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1198\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"938\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"956\" data-section-id=\"1yji93k\" data-start=\"938\">Blue duct tape</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"977\" data-section-id=\"9jtc24\" data-start=\"957\">Size: 48mm x 20m</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1002\" data-section-id=\"1q7q5ud\" data-start=\"978\">Strong adhesive hold</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1059\" data-section-id=\"17um14k\" data-start=\"1003\">Suitable for sealing, bundling, repairs, and marking</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1103\" data-section-id=\"aef1yj\" data-start=\"1060\">U