(2024, 4, 51, 0, 'Duct tape 48MM x 20M GREEN GS2586', 'duct-tape-48mm-x-20m-green-gs2586', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 400, 'per_quantity', 'Duct Tape 48mm x 20m Green is a strong, durable multi-purpose tape suitable for sealing, bundling, repairs, marking, and general heavy-duty use. Ideal for home, office, warehouse, garden, and trade environments.', '<p data-end=\"525\" data-start=\"264\"><strong data-end=\"294\" data-start=\"264\">Duct Tape 48mm x 20m Green</strong> is a reliable adhesive tape designed for practical everyday use. With a <strong data-end=\"381\" data-start=\"367\">48mm width</strong> and <strong data-end=\"410\" data-start=\"386\">20 metre roll length</strong>, it is suitable for securing parcels, bundling items, temporary repairs, packaging, and general maintenance tasks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"828\" data-start=\"527\">The green colour makes it useful for colour coding, marking, garden use, outdoor jobs, storage, and organising areas where clear identification is needed. It is a great product for wholesalers, hardware shops, pound stores, convenience stores, market traders, DIY sections, and general retail display.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"847\" data-start=\"830\"><strong data-end=\"847\" data-start=\"830\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1096\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"848\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"867\" data-section-id=\"92vqd1\" data-start=\"848\">Green duct tape</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"888\" data-section-id=\"9jtc24\" data-start=\"868\">Size: 48mm x 20m</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"913\" data-section-id=\"1q7q5ud\" data-start=\"889\">Strong adhesive hold</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"970\" data-section-id=\"17um14k\" data-start=\"914\">Suitable for sealing, bundling, repairs, and marking</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1032\" data-section-id=\"kvr8i8\" data-start=\"971\">Useful for home, warehouse, garden, office, and trade use.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 'rh2j3dt0zydicmhdczmkxhev_large1782210973.jpg', NULL, NULL, NUL