(2025, 4, 51, 0, 'Jumbo Tape 250m TPB01 Brown 50x250 GS0095', 'jumbo-tape-250m-tpb01-brown-50x250-gs0095', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 600, 'per_quantity', 'Jumbo Tape 250m TPB01 Brown 50x250 is a strong brown packing tape designed for sealing boxes, parcels, cartons, and bulk packaging. With a large 50mm x 250m roll size, it is ideal for warehouse, wholesale, and heavy-use packing environments.', '<p data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"298\"><strong data-end=\"336\" data-start=\"298\">Jumbo Tape 250m TPB01 Brown 50x250</strong> is a heavy-duty brown packing tape made for regular and high-volume packaging use. The extra-long <strong data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"435\">250 metre roll</strong> provides excellent value and lasts longer than standard tape rolls, making it perfect for warehouses, dispatch areas, shops, offices, and storage rooms.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"851\" data-start=\"608\">With a practical <strong data-end=\"639\" data-start=\"625\">50mm width</strong>, this tape is suitable for securely sealing cardboard boxes, parcels, cartons, and shipping packages. The brown finish blends well with standard cardboard packaging, giving parcels a clean and professional look.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"981\" data-start=\"853\">Ideal for wholesalers, packaging suppliers, hardware stores, market traders, e-commerce businesses, and retail packing sections.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1000\" data-start=\"983\"><strong data-end=\"1000\" data-start=\"983\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1264\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1001\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1029\" data-section-id=\"p7b1mw\" data-start=\"1001\">Jumbo brown packing tape</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1051\" data-section-id=\"1xyz7o0\" data-start=\"1030\">Size: 50mm x 250m</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1085\" data-section-id=\"u2zf8z\" data-start=\"1052\">Extra-long roll for heavy use</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1110\" data-section-id=\"1q7q5ud\" data-start=\"1086\">Strong adhesive hold</li>\r\