(2037, 4, 54, 0, 'Super Glue A1 Avatar P12 SGA1', 'super-glue-a1-avatar-p12-sga1', '6957544682701', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 3000, 'per_quantity', 'Super Glue A1 Avatar P12 SGA1 is a fast-bonding adhesive supplied in a convenient pack of 12. Ideal for quick repairs, DIY use, crafts, and general household fixes.', '<p data-end=\"481\" data-start=\"217\"><strong data-end=\"250\" data-start=\"217\">Super Glue A1 Avatar P12 SGA1</strong> is a strong instant adhesive designed for reliable everyday bonding. The fast-drying formula helps create a secure hold in seconds, making it suitable for small repairs, craft work, office use, home maintenance, and workshop jobs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"727\" data-start=\"483\">This <strong data-end=\"502\" data-start=\"488\">pack of 12</strong> is ideal for wholesale, retail displays, hardware stores, pound shops, convenience stores, and DIY sections. Each tube is compact and easy to use, making it perfect for customers who need a quick and simple bonding solution.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"849\" data-start=\"729\">Suitable for bonding a range of common materials including <strong data-end=\"848\" data-start=\"788\">plastic, metal, rubber, ceramic, leather, wood, and more</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"868\" data-start=\"851\"><strong data-end=\"868\" data-start=\"851\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1105\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"869\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"900\" data-section-id=\"pwds50\" data-start=\"869\">Pack of 12 super glue tubes</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"934\" data-section-id=\"12yffih\" data-start=\"901\">Fast-setting instant adhesive</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"962\" data-section-id=\"ifscam\" data-start=\"935\">Strong and durable bond</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"997\" data-section-id=\"au0it0\" data-start=\"963\">Suitable for multiple surfaces</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1036\" data-section-id=\"141lwza\" data-start=\"998\">Ideal for repairs, crafts, and DIY</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1075\" d