(2042, 4, 142, 0, 'Invoice Book Mini 935 - GS1745', 'invoice-book-mini-935-gs1745', '6972683200340, 6924181829356', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 5000, 'per_quantity', 'A compact mini invoice book ideal for recording sales, payments, orders, and customer transactions. Perfect for shops, market stalls, delivery drivers, tradespeople, and small businesses.', '<p data-end=\"544\" data-start=\"309\">The <strong data-end=\"338\" data-start=\"313\">Invoice Book Mini 935</strong> is a handy business stationery item designed for quick and simple invoice writing. Its mini size makes it easy to carry in a bag, keep at a till point, store in a vehicle, or use while working on the move.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"821\" data-start=\"546\">It is suitable for retailers, wholesalers, tradespeople, mobile workers, market sellers, delivery services, and general office use. This invoice book helps businesses keep clear records of sales, payments, customer details, quantities, and prices in a neat and organised way.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"840\" data-start=\"823\"><strong data-end=\"840\" data-start=\"823\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1160\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"842\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"863\" data-section-id=\"1fx00qb\" data-start=\"842\">Mini invoice book</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"883\" data-section-id=\"1adlvts\" data-start=\"864\">Model/code: 935</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"913\" data-section-id=\"9es5je\" data-start=\"884\">Compact and easy to carry</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"976\" data-section-id=\"sizv2b\" data-start=\"914\">Suitable for invoices, receipts, orders, and sales records</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1042\" data-section-id=\"pb9po3\" data-start=\"977\">Ideal for shops, offices, tradespeople, and mobile businesses</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1099\" data-section-id=\"lh93zy\" data-start=\"1043\">Helps keep customer transactions clear and organised.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 'v2jkse2yzu4nrlwevz3hiuly_large1782147298.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-06-30 20:02:46'),
