(2044, 4, 142, 0, 'vegtable cutter cy-8009', 'vegtable-cutter-cy-8009', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 96, 'per_quantity', 'A handy vegetable cutter designed to make food preparation quicker and easier. Ideal for slicing and cutting vegetables for home kitchens, catering use, takeaways, restaurants, and food prep areas.', '<p data-end=\"555\" data-start=\"325\">The <strong data-end=\"357\" data-start=\"329\">Vegetable Cutter CY-8009</strong> is a practical kitchen tool made for fast and convenient food preparation. It is suitable for cutting and preparing a variety of vegetables, helping save time in busy kitchens and everyday cooking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"804\" data-start=\"557\">This cutter is ideal for home users, catering businesses, restaurants, takeaways, caf&eacute;s, and food service environments. Its simple design makes it easy to use for preparing salads, stir-fries, garnishes, meal prep, and general cooking ingredients.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"924\" data-start=\"806\">A useful wholesale kitchen accessory for retailers, cash and carries, homeware stores, and catering supply businesses.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"943\" data-start=\"926\"><strong data-end=\"943\" data-start=\"926\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1288\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"945\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"965\" data-section-id=\"14jymti\" data-start=\"945\">Vegetable cutter</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"989\" data-section-id=\"31bb1l\" data-start=\"966\">Model/code: CY-8009</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1039\" data-section-id=\"17hi3za\" data-start=\"990\">Helps make food preparation faster and easier</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1099\" data-section-id=\"1s6zste\" data-start=\"1040\">Suitable for cutting and preparing different vegetables</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1164\" data-section-id=\"jgq9tx\" data-start=\"1100\">Ideal for home, catering, restaurant, takeaway, and caf&eacute; use</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1233\" data-section-id=\"u87fkt\" data-start=\"1165\">Useful for salads, cooking prep, garnishes, and meal preparation</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1288\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-section-id=\"1dfgf2\" data-start=\"1234\">Practical everyday kitchen tool for wholesale supply.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 'uu1ibtdvj4bfycn50nbhv3xa_large1782147064.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-06-30 20:01:06'),
