(2046, 4, 142, 0, 'GS2673 - PADDED ENEVELOPE A5 PK50', 'gs2673-padded-enevelope-a5-pk50', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 120, 'per_quantity', 'A pack of 50 A5 padded envelopes, perfect for sending documents, cards, photos, small books, and lightweight products while helping protect items during postage.', '<section data-testid=\"conversation-turn-16\" data-turn=\"assistant\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:8117758d-692a-43fe-b359-fcb23c9afb2c-47\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:8117758d-692a-43fe-b359-fcb23c9afb2c-47\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<p data-end=\"548\" data-start=\"287\">The <strong data-end=\"318\" data-start=\"291\">Padded Envelope A5 PK50</strong> is a useful mailing and packaging option for businesses that regularly send smaller items. Each pack contains <strong data-end=\"455\" data-start=\"429\">50 A5 padded envelopes</strong>, making it ideal for offices, retailers, warehouses, online sellers, and general postal use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"550\">These envelopes are designed with a protective padded lining to help reduce damage from handling, scratches, and light knocks during delivery. Their A5 size makes them suitable for compact items such as greeting cards, photos, certificates, small booklets, invoices, accessories, samples, and other everyday products.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"970\" data-start=\"869\">They are a reliable choice for keeping items secure, tidy, and professionally packed before dispatch.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"972\"><strong data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"972\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1307\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"991\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1025\" data-section-id=\"siqhqc\" data-start=\"991\">Pack of 50 A5 padded envelopes</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1072\" data-section-id=\"sky583\" data-start=\"1026\">Protective padded lining for safer mailing</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1146\" data-section-id=\"57ai2g\" data-start=\"1073\">Suitable for small documents, cards, photos, and lightweight products</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1206\" data-section-id=\"1d8d9j9\" data-start=\"1147\">Ideal for e-commerce, office, retail, and warehouse use</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1253\" data-section-id=\"5arff5\" data-start=\"1207\">Helps keep posted items neat and protected</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1307\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-section-id=\"2vexne\" data-start=\"1254\">Practical wholesale mailing and packaging essential.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</section>\r\n', 't4pj3lwhyi2f3tivjj515f00_large1782146372.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:25', '2026-06-30 19:56:57');
