(2082, 4, 48, 0, 'Nail Clipper pk12 NEW mix LF7603 / 8 / 6 - GS2304', 'nail-clipper-pk12-new-mix-lf7603-8-6-gs2304', 'GS-code', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 122, 'per_quantity', 'The LF7603 / LF7608 / LF7606 Mixed Nail Clipper is a practical and reliable grooming essential, supplied in a pack of 12 mixed designs. Designed for clean and easy nail trimming, it is ideal for wholesale resale in convenience stores, pound shops, beauty shops, salons, barbers, pharmacies, market stalls, and general retail outlets.', '<p data-end=\"710\" data-start=\"368\">The <strong data-end=\"437\" data-start=\"396\">LF7603 / LF7608 / LF7606 Nail Clipper</strong> range is an everyday personal care accessory suitable for a wide range of customers. Designed for simple and effective nail care, each clipper features a strong build and sharp cutting edge to help provide a clean, neat, and precise trim for both fingernails and toenails.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1012\" data-start=\"712\">This product comes as a <strong data-end=\"757\" data-start=\"736\">mixed design pack</strong>, giving retailers a more varied and eye-catching option for display. The compact and lightweight design makes it easy to use, store, and carry, making it suitable for home grooming, travel bags, toiletry kits, salons, barbers, and personal care sections.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1349\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1014\">Supplied in a <strong data-end=\"1042\" data-start=\"1028\">pack of 12</strong>, the LF7603 / LF7608 / LF7606 Mixed Nail Clipper is ideal for wholesale buyers looking for an affordable, practical, and fast-moving grooming product. It is well suited for convenience stores, discount shops, pound shops, beauty retailers, pharmacies, salons, barbers, market traders, and online resellers.</p>\r\n', '51ujoxo5qpjcxof3kgymk2oj_large1782140538.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '',