(2120, 4, 48, 0, 'Nail Clipper G357 Mix Design', 'nail-clipper-g357-mix-design', '6932779605039', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'The Nail Clipper G357 Mix Design is a practical grooming accessory featuring assorted designs, making it suitable for everyday nail care and retail resale. Compact, lightweight, and easy to use, these nail clippers are ideal for personal care sections, beauty stores, convenience shops, salons, barbers, market stalls, and wholesale hygiene ranges.', '<p data-end=\"765\" data-start=\"494\">The <strong data-end=\"530\" data-start=\"498\">Nail Clipper G357 Mix Design</strong> is a useful everyday grooming item designed for trimming nails neatly and conveniently. With mixed designs, this product offers more variety than plain nail clippers, making it more attractive for retail display and impulse purchases.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1107\" data-start=\"767\">These nail clippers are compact and easy to store, making them suitable for home use, travel, handbags, grooming kits, and personal care ranges. They are ideal for wholesalers, discount stores, pharmacies, beauty shops, salons, barbers, market traders, and convenience stores looking to stock affordable and fast-moving grooming essentials.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1130\" data-section-id=\"1qc8btb\" data-start=\"1109\">Product Details</h3>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1282\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1131\"><strong data-end=\"1148\" data-start=\"1131\">Product Code:</strong> G357<br data-end=\"1156\" data-start=\"1153\" />\r\n<strong data-end=\"1173\" data-start=\"1156\">Product Type:</strong> Nail Clipper<br data-end=\"1189\" data-start=\"1186\" />\r\n<strong data-end=\"1200\" data-start=\"1189\">Design:</strong> Mix Design<br data-end=\"1214\" data-start=\"1211\" />\r\n<strong data-end=\"1227\" data-start=\"1214\">Category:</strong> Health &amp; Beauty / Personal Care.</p>\r\n', 'rmajktyecafpf50h253dvi2r_large1782135268.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 