(2122, 4, 48, 0, 'Nail Clipper - 0818 Pack Of 12 Plain - GS0547', 'nail-clipper-0818-pack-of-12-plain-gs0547', '6920709300628', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', '\r\nA pack of 12 plain nail clippers, designed for everyday nail grooming and suitable for retail resale. Compact, lightweight, and easy to use, these clippers are ideal for personal care sections, convenience stores, salons, barbers, market stalls, and wholesale hygiene ranges.', '<p data-end=\"617\" data-start=\"383\">The <strong data-end=\"425\" data-start=\"387\">Nail Clipper 0818 Plain Pack of 12</strong> is a practical and affordable grooming accessory for everyday nail care. Each clipper features a simple plain design, making it suitable for a wide range of customers and retail environments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"913\" data-start=\"619\">This multipack is ideal for wholesalers, discount stores, pharmacies, beauty shops, salons, barbers, market traders, and convenience stores looking to stock essential personal care items. Its compact size makes it easy to display, store, and sell as part of a grooming or hygiene product range.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-end=\"936\" data-section-id=\"1qc8btb\" data-start=\"915\">Product Details</h3>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1110\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"937\"><strong data-end=\"954\" data-start=\"937\">Product Code:</strong> 0818<br data-end=\"962\" data-start=\"959\" />\r\n<strong data-end=\"979\" data-start=\"962\">Product Type:</strong> Nail Clipper<br data-end=\"995\" data-start=\"992\" />\r\n<strong data-end=\"1006\" data-start=\"995\">Design:</strong> Plain<br data-end=\"1015\" data-start=\"1012\" />\r\n<strong data-end=\"1029\" data-start=\"1015\">Pack Size:</strong> 12 Pieces.</p>\r\n', 'feuknbv14qfjfsvvycgckuaj_large1782133059.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2