(2157, 4, 53, 0, 'SGK BALLOON PACK OF 12 PK12 2.8G STANDARD - GS1496', 'sgk-balloon-pack-of-12-pk12-28g-standard-gs1496', '6922081612344', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 3000, 'per_quantity', 'SGK Balloon Pack of 12 includes 12 standard 2.8g balloons, ideal for parties, celebrations, decorations, events, and everyday fun. A simple party essential for homes, shops, schools, and event use.', '<p data-end=\"501\" data-start=\"223\">Bring colour, fun, and a party atmosphere to any occasion with the <strong data-end=\"339\" data-start=\"313\">SGK Balloon Pack of 12</strong>. Each pack contains <strong data-end=\"384\" data-start=\"360\">12 standard balloons</strong>, with each balloon weighing approximately <strong data-end=\"435\" data-start=\"427\">2.8g</strong>, making them suitable for general decoration and celebration use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"786\" data-start=\"503\">These balloons are perfect for <strong data-end=\"669\" data-start=\"534\">birthday parties, weddings, baby showers, anniversaries, school events, shop displays, family gatherings, and seasonal celebrations</strong>. They can be used to decorate walls, tables, ceilings, entrance areas, party backdrops, gift areas, or event spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1129\" data-start=\"788\">The compact <strong data-end=\"818\" data-start=\"800\">PK12 pack size</strong> makes this product easy to display, store, and sell in retail environments. It is a great choice for <strong data-end=\"1027\" data-start=\"920\">party shops, convenience stores, pound shops, wholesalers, cash and carry stores, and general retailers</strong>. Customers can easily pick up a pack for last-minute party decorations or everyday celebration needs.</p>\r\n', 'xjoyrmiwdijznthxi1eckf4d_large1782126102.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-06-20 22:20:26', '2026-06-30 17:11:35');
