(2161, 6, 124, 0, 'Lighter BBQ DY012 ZY3894', 'lighter-bbq-dy012-zy3894', '6945171101238', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 70000, 'per_quantity', 'The 4Smoke BBQ Lighter MF-3894 PK24 is a practical long BBQ lighter with a colourful handle and straight metal tube design. Ideal for lighting BBQs, candles, gas cookers, fireplaces and camping stoves, supplied in a 24-piece countertop display box.', '<section data-testid=\"conversation-turn-30\" data-turn=\"assistant\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:1d8a0fc8-131e-4f33-8bd1-a9473727fdcb-14\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:1d8a0fc8-131e-4f33-8bd1-a9473727fdcb-14\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<p data-end=\"596\" data-start=\"282\">The <strong data-end=\"344\" data-start=\"309\">4Smoke BBQ Lighter MF-3894 PK24</strong> is a bright and practical lighter designed for everyday home, kitchen and outdoor use. Featuring a long <strong data-end=\"472\" data-start=\"449\">straight metal tube</strong>, it gives users extra reach when lighting BBQ grills, candles, gas stoves, fireplaces, ovens and other hard-to-reach areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"847\" data-start=\"598\">The extended tube helps keep hands further away from the flame, making it safer and more convenient than a standard pocket lighter. Its easy ignition trigger and comfortable handle make it simple to use for regular household, garden and camping use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1089\" data-start=\"849\">Each lighter comes in assorted bright colours, including blue, green, yellow and white, giving the display a bold and eye-catching look. The colourful design makes it ideal for retail shelves, seasonal BBQ displays and impulse-buy sections.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1364\" data-start=\"1091\">Supplied in a <strong data-end=\"1126\" data-start=\"1105\">pack of 24 pieces</strong> in a ready-to-display <strong data-end=\"1174\" data-start=\"1149\">4Smoke countertop box</strong>, this BBQ lighter is a great wholesale and retail product for convenience stores, pound shops, hardware shops, homeware s