(2174, 6, 124, 0, 'BBQ LIGHTER JET FLAME FLEXIBLE PK20 - GS2831', 'bbq-lighter-jet-flame-flexible-pk20-gs2831', '50603802300069', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 12000, 'per_quantity', 'The BBQ Lighter Jet Flame Flexible PK20 is a practical windproof jet flame lighter with a flexible metal tube, ideal for lighting BBQs, gas cookers, candles, fireplaces and hard-to-reach areas. Supplied in a pack of 20, with assorted transparent colours and a countertop display box.', '<p data-end=\"701\" data-start=\"324\">The <strong data-end=\"399\" data-start=\"351\">BBQ Lighter Jet Flame Flexible PK20 - GS2831</strong> is a reliable and convenient lighter designed for everyday home, outdoor and BBQ use. Featuring a powerful <strong data-end=\"520\" data-start=\"507\">jet flame</strong>, it provides a strong and focused flame that performs well even in windy conditions, making it especially useful for barbecues, camping, fireplaces, gas stoves and outdoor cooking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1007\" data-start=\"703\">Each lighter comes with a <strong data-end=\"752\" data-start=\"729\">flexible metal tube</strong>, allowing the flame to reach awkward or deep areas safely and easily. This makes it perfect for lighting BBQ grills, candles in jars, pilot lights, ovens, fireplaces and other hard-to-reach spots without needing to place your hand too close to the flame.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1285\" data-start=\"1009\">The lighters are designed with a comfortable grip and easy ignition button, making them simple to use. The transparent coloured fuel chamber allows users to see the gas level clearly, while the assorted colours give the display a bright and attractive look for retail shelves.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1549\" data-start=\"1287\">Supplied as a <strong data-end=\"1322\" data-start=\"1301\">pack of 20 pieces</strong> in a ready-to-display box, the <strong data-end=\"1395\" data-start=\"1354\">GS2831 Flexible Jet Flame BBQ Lighter</strong> is a great wholesale and retail product for convenience stores, hardware shops, pound shops, homeware stores, BBQ sections and seasonal outdoor displays.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1570\" data-start=\"1551\"><strong data-end=\"1568\" data-start=\"1551\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1945\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1571\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1599\" data-section-id=\"1gg8g2w\" data-start=\"1571\">Product code: <strong data-end=\"1597\" data-start=\"1587\">GS2831</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1628\" data-section-id=\"1vmhxgl\" data-start=\"1600\">Pack size: <strong data-end=\"1626\" data-start=\"1613\">20 pieces</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1664\" data-section-id=\"1c4srxl\" data-start=\"1629\">Windproof <strong data-end=\"1654\" data-start=\"1641\">jet flame</strong> lighter</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1712\" data-section-id=\"1gj9svg\" data-start=\"1665\">Flexible metal tube for hard-to-reach areas</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1776\" data-section-id=\"1auqq0j\" data-start=\"1713\">Ideal for BBQs, candles, gas stoves, fireplaces and camping</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1809\" data-section-id=\"g4362k\" data-start=\"1777\">Assorted transparent colours</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1848\" data-section-id=\"w0gcsw\" data-start=\"1810\">Easy ignition and comfortable grip</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1889\" data-section-id=\"hmr88s\" data-start=\"1849\">Supplied in a countertop display box</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1945\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-section-id=\"psebtw\" data-start=\"1890\">Great for wholesale, retail and seasonal BBQ displays</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 'Screenshot_6_7_2026_12649_showroom_inflowinventory1783336078.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-07-06 16:14:48', '2026-07-06 17:40:58'),
