(2176, 6, 25, 0, 'CLIPPER GAS 300ML PK12', 'clipper-gas-300ml-pk12', 'PK12', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'The Clipper Butane Gas 250ml + 50ml Free is a universal butane gas refill can, suitable for compatible refillable lighters, gas torches and other gas-powered accessories. With 250ml plus 50ml free, it offers great value and is ideal for convenience stores, vape shops, off-licences, smoking accessory retailers and hardware sections.', '<p data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"428\">The <strong data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"455\">Clipper Butane Gas 250ml + 50ml Free</strong> is a practical refill gas can designed for customers using refillable lighters, utility lighters, gas torches and other compatible gas-powered products. Each can includes <strong data-end=\"700\" data-start=\"667\">250ml plus an extra 50ml free</strong>, giving customers added value in a larger refill size.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1048\" data-start=\"757\">The can features a <strong data-end=\"795\" data-start=\"776\">universal valve</strong>, making it suitable for a wide range of compatible refillable lighters and gas accessories. Its strong Clipper branding and bright yellow packaging make it easy to recognise and ideal for retail shelves, smoking accessory sections and counter displays.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1333\" data-start=\"1050\">This butane gas refill is a useful add-on product to sell alongside Clipper lighters, flints, lighter fluid, BBQ lighters and smoking accessories. It is perfect for convenience stores, vape shops, off-licences, pound shops, hardware stores, homeware shops and general retail outlets.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1354\" data-start=\"1335\"><strong data-end=\"1352\" data-start=\"1335\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1832\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1355\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1413\" data-section-id=\"1utq9by\" data-start=\"1355\">Product name: <strong data-end=\"1411\" data-start=\"1371\">Clipper Butane Gas 250m