(2177, 6, 25, 0, 'CLIPPER GAS CARTRIDGE CLP250 400ML', 'clipper-gas-cartridge-clp250-400ml', '8412766131447', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'The Clipper Butane Gas CLP250 is a larger-size butane gas refill can designed for refilling compatible lighters, gas torches and other suitable gas-powered accessories. Supplied in Clipper-branded packaging, it is ideal for convenience stores, vape shops, off-licences, smoking accessory retailers and hardware sections.', '<p data-end=\"752\" data-start=\"400\">The <strong data-end=\"456\" data-start=\"427\">Clipper Butane Gas CLP250</strong> is a practical butane gas refill can designed for customers who use refillable gas lighters, utility lighters, gas torches and other compatible gas-powered products. With its larger refill can size, it is ideal for customers who want a longer-lasting option compared to smaller lighter gas cans.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1084\" data-start=\"754\">Supplied in the classic <strong data-end=\"817\" data-start=\"778\">Clipper yellow and blue branded can</strong>, this product has strong shelf recognition and works well alongside Clipper lighters, flints, lighter fluid and smoking accessories. The can is designed for easy refilling of compatible products and is suitable for regular household, kitchen, camping and retail use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1382\" data-start=\"1086\">The <strong data-end=\"1100\" data-start=\"1090\">CLP250</strong> is a strong add-on product for lighter displays and is ideal for placement near tills, smoking accessory sections, hardware shelves, kitchenware areas and camping displays. Its trusted Clipper branding gives customers confidence and helps create a professional retail presentation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1403\" data-start=\"1384\"><strong data-end=\"1401\" data-start=\"1384\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1941\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1404\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1451\" data-section-id=\"mcv8pn\" data-