(2180, 6, 25, 0, 'CLIPPER LIGHTER D48 E CP11RH - PRINTED', 'clipper-lighter-d48-e-cp11rh-printed', 'D48 E CP11RH', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'The Clipper Lighter D48 CP11RH - Mixed Design features original Clipper reusable lighters in a mixed selection of plain colours and printed designs. Supplied in branded 48-piece countertop display trays, these refillable and reusable lighters are ideal for convenience stores, vape shops, off-licences and smoking accessory displays.', '<section data-testid=\"conversation-turn-78\" data-turn=\"assistant\" data-turn-id=\"request-6a4b9284-dc2c-83eb-bfc2-ff287f516ae4-9\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6a4b9284-dc2c-83eb-bfc2-ff287f516ae4-9\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<p data-end=\"758\" data-start=\"437\">The <strong data-end=\"509\" data-start=\"464\">Clipper Lighter D48 CP11RH - Mixed Design</strong> is a retail-ready display of original <strong data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"548\">Clipper reusable lighters</strong>, supplied in a variety of assorted styles. This mixed range includes both <strong data-end=\"677\" data-start=\"652\">plain colour lighters</strong> and <strong data-end=\"709\" data-start=\"682\">printed graphic designs</strong>, giving customers a wider choice in one display.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1098\" data-start=\"760\">Each lighter is made in the classic Clipper reusable format, making it refillable and suitable for everyday use. The compact size makes it easy to carry in a pocket, bag or pouch, while the mixed selection of colours and designs makes the range appealing to customers who want either a simple lighter or a more eye-catching printed style.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1424\" data-start=\"1100\">The display includes bright plain colours, gradient finishes, leaf designs, floral prints, novelty graphics and themed artwork. Supplied in branded <strong data-end=\"1288\" data-start=\"1248\">Clipper D48 countertop display trays</strong>, this range creates strong shelf presence and works well as an impuls