(2182, 6, 25, 0, 'CLIPPER FLUID 100ML PK6', 'clipper-fluid-100ml-pk6', '8412765981388', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'The Clipper Lighter Fluid is a refill fluid for compatible petrol-style refillable lighters. Supplied in Clipper-branded tins, it is ideal for smoking accessory retailers, convenience stores, off-licences, vape shops and counter display sections.', '<section data-testid=\"conversation-turn-76\" data-turn=\"assistant\" data-turn-id=\"request-6a4b9284-dc2c-83eb-bfc2-ff287f516ae4-8\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6a4b9284-dc2c-83eb-bfc2-ff287f516ae4-8\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<p data-end=\"637\" data-start=\"322\">The <strong data-end=\"374\" data-start=\"349\">Clipper Lighter Fluid</strong> is a practical refill accessory designed for use with compatible petrol-style refillable lighters. Supplied in the classic yellow <strong data-end=\"528\" data-start=\"505\">Clipper-branded tin</strong>, this product is an essential add-on item for retailers selling refillable lighters and smoking accessories.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"900\" data-start=\"639\">The lighter fluid is suitable for customers who want to refill and extend the use of their compatible reusable lighters. Its compact tin design makes it easy to store, display and sell alongside lighters, flints, butane gas and other smoking accessory products.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1207\" data-start=\"902\">With strong Clipper branding and a clean retail appearance, this lighter fluid is ideal for countertop displays, shelf displays and impulse-buy sections. It is a reliable everyday accessory for convenience stores, off-licences, vape shops, smoking accessory stores, pound shops and general retail outlets.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1228\" data-start=\"1209\"><strong data-end=\"1226\" data-start=\"1209\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1727\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1229\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1272\" data-section-id=\"mj9et0\" data-start=\"1229\">Produc