play</strong> is a strong impulse-buy product with excellent visual appeal.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1588\" data-start=\"1569\"><strong data-end=\"1586\" data-start=\"1569\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2032\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1589\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1630\" data-section-id=\"1vh31sl\" data-start=\"1589\"><strong data-end=\"1628\" data-start=\"1591\">Clipper reusable lighter gift set</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1660\" data-section-id=\"1wow0ze\" data-start=\"1631\"><strong data-end=\"1651\" data-start=\"1633\">Leaves Pattern</strong> design</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1684\" data-section-id=\"vpat0g\" data-start=\"1661\">Premium gold finish</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1727\" data-section-id=\"12volf5\" data-start=\"1685\">Refillable and reusable lighter design</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1757\" data-section-id=\"9es5je\" data-start=\"1728\">Compact and easy to carry</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1806\" data-section-id=\"z5zccw\" data-start=\"1758\">Supplied with branded gold presentation case</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1843\" data-section-id=\"m25ljf\" data-start=\"1807\">Countertop display tray included</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1885\" data-section-id=\"18ay6ih\" data-start=\"1844\">Stylish black and gold retail display</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1940\" data-section-id=\"1ltvmj9\" data-start=\"1886\">Great for gifting and collectable lighter displays</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2032\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-section-id=\"13lbuq0\" data-start=\"1941\">Suitable for convenience stores, vape shops, off-licences and smoking accessory retailers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 'toqfapwofruc1flwobrnbtxm_large1783434047.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-07-07 18:55:09', '2026-07-07 19:50:47'),
