(2213, 6, 25, 0, 'CLIPPER LIGHTER D30 FCP22RH - PRINT', 'clipper-lighter-d30-fcp22rh-print', '8412766134448, 8412765992322, 8447218242600', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'The Clipper Micro Lighter PK30 range features assorted compact Clipper reusable lighters in stylish colours and printed designs. Supplied in 30-piece display trays, these lighters are ideal for smoking accessory retailers, convenience stores, vape shops and impulse-buy counter displays.', '<p data-end=\"647\" data-start=\"321\">The <strong data-end=\"384\" data-start=\"348\">Clipper Micro Lighter PK30 range</strong> offers a selection of compact, reusable Clipper lighters in a variety of eye-catching colours and designs. Each range is supplied in a <strong data-end=\"556\" data-start=\"520\">30-piece countertop display tray</strong>, making it easy to merchandise on retail counters, shelves and smoking accessory sections.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"962\" data-start=\"649\">This collection includes bold metallic finishes, gradient colours and printed artwork designs, giving retailers a strong mix of styles to suit different customer preferences. Options include <strong data-end=\"961\" data-start=\"840\">icy micro colours, rose gold, electric green, blue gradient, gold tattoo, symmetry animals and kaleido leaves designs</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1242\" data-start=\"964\">The compact micro size makes each lighter easy to carry, store and use, while the reusable Clipper format makes it a popular choice for everyday use. With strong brand recognition and attractive display packaging, these lighters are ideal for impulse purchases and repeat sales.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1461\" data-start=\"1244\">Perfect for convenience stores, off-licences, vape shops, smoking accessory stores, gift shops and general retail outlets, the <strong data-end=\"1399\" data-start=\"1371\">Clipper Micro PK30 range</strong> is a strong-selling product line with excellent shelf appeal.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1482\" data-start=\"1463\"><strong data-end=\"1480\" data-start=\"1463\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1902\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1483\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1518\" data-section-id=\"10uwbpx\" data-start=\"1483\"><strong data-end=\"1516\" data-start=\"1485\">Clipper Micro lighter range</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1559\" data-section-id=\"c55ivt\" data-start=\"1519\">Pack size: <strong data-end=\"1557\" data-start=\"1532\">30 pieces per display</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1590\" data-section-id=\"17tgkih\" data-start=\"1560\">Compact micro lighter size</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1618\" data-section-id=\"17dfx2o\" data-start=\"1591\">Reusable Clipper design</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1651\" data-section-id=\"18e8nlc\" data-start=\"1619\">Assorted colours and designs</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1702\" data-section-id=\"1e2wzc5\" data-start=\"1652\">Includes metallic, gradient and printed styles</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1743\" data-section-id=\"1f3q6o5\" data-start=\"1703\">Supplied in countertop display trays</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1784\" data-section-id=\"kkech1\" data-start=\"1744\">Great for smoking accessory displays</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1815\" data-section-id=\"w2jmso\" data-start=\"1785\">Strong impulse-buy product</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1902\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-section-id=\"1p5uvr4\" data-start=\"1816\">Suitable for convenience stores, vape shops, off-licences and general retail outlets</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 'ld34y2ik5pqtgiv10y1tusag_large1783432521.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '2026-07-07 18:55:09', '2026-07-07 19:25:21'),
