(2221, 6, 25, 0, 'CLIPPER LIGHTER D12 CMP11R - ELEGANT', 'clipper-lighter-d12-cmp11r-elegant', '8447218239242, 8412766132338', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'per_quantity', 'The Clipper Reusable Elegant Lighter Gift Set features stylish black and gold Clipper lighters with premium elegant designs, presented in a sleek display stand with individual cases. Compact, refillable and reusable, this set is ideal for gifting, smoking accessory displays and premium retail counters.', '<section data-testid=\"conversation-turn-36\" data-turn=\"assistant\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:1d8a0fc8-131e-4f33-8bd1-a9473727fdcb-17\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:1d8a0fc8-131e-4f33-8bd1-a9473727fdcb-17\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<p data-end=\"722\" data-start=\"333\">The <strong data-end=\"405\" data-start=\"360\">Clipper Reusable Elegant Lighter Gift Set</strong> is a premium-style lighter display featuring a selection of stylish <strong data-end=\"518\" data-start=\"474\">black and gold Clipper reusable lighters</strong> with elegant patterned designs. With designs including geometric prints, dotted patterns and bold gold detailing, this range offers a classy and eye-catching look that stands out well in retail displays.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1024\" data-start=\"724\">Each lighter is compact, practical and reusable, making it ideal for regular everyday use. The refillable design gives customers a longer-lasting option compared to disposable lighters, while the premium artwork and matching presentation cases add extra value and make the product feel more giftable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1285\" data-start=\"1026\">The display includes individual lighter cases, helping present each lighter in a clean and premium way. The black and gold colour theme gives the range a luxury feel, making it suitable for customers looking for something more stylish than a standard lighter.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1531\" data-start=\"1287\">Perfect for convenience stores, off-licences, vape shops, smoking accessory stores, gift shops and general retail outlets, the <strong data-end=\"1458\" data-start=\"1414\">Clipper Elegant reusable lighter display</strong> is a strong impulse-buy and gifting product with excellent shelf appeal.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1552\" data-start=\"1533\"><strong data-end=\"1550\" data-start=\"1533\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1981\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1553\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1589\" data-section-id=\"1pca82x\" data-start=\"1553\"><strong data-end=\"1587\" data-start=\"1555\">Clipper reusable lighter set</strong></li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1626\" data-section-id=\"gdq0ry\" data-start=\"1590\">Premium <strong data-end=\"1611\" data-start=\"1600\">Elegant</strong> design range</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1666\" data-section-id=\"g0irr1\" data-start=\"1627\">Stylish black and gold colour theme</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1696\" data-section-id=\"i12nje\" data-start=\"1667\">Assorted elegant patterns</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1739\" data-section-id=\"12volf5\" data-start=\"1697\">Refillable and reusable lighter design</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1769\" data-section-id=\"9es5je\" data-start=\"1740\">Compact and easy to carry</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1817\" data-section-id=\"fpppxs\" data-start=\"1770\">Supplied with individual presentation cases</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1844\" data-section-id=\"1g6t3ba\" data-start=\"1818\">Display stand included</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1891\" data-section-id=\"1k8xk4w\" data-start=\"1845\">Great for gifting and impulse-buy displays</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1981\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-section-id=\"z4ql5l\" data-start=\"1892\">Suitable for convenience stores, vape shops, gift shops and smoking accessory retailers&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</section>\r\n', 'ld34y2ik5pqtgiv10y1tusag_large1783431700.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 